{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01SheMj7qe5sKkEN8iVSQRBp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the project state. Here are the worst-tier predictions for every experiment in the plan.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  论文彻底放弃 calibration claim。Reframe 为三部分负面结果贡献：\n  (1) \"Why contamination calibration is harder than it looks\" — 系统性展示 IRT+γ 在 LLM 评估中失败的结构性原因\n  (N 不足、local independence 违反、信号质量不够），对社区的 warning；\n  (2) Signal failure mode characterization — Min-K++ 方向性反转 (Cohen's d=-1.98) 是最可引用的发现，\n  S1 作为唯一可靠信号的实证、d100 标签退化的解释；\n  (3) Benchmark-dependent contamination effects — ARC 灾难性遗忘 vs GSM8K 天然抗性 vs MMLU 微弱效应，\n  作为 empirical finding 独立于方法是否 work。\n  Fisher Info 分析 reframe 为 identifiability impossibility result。\n  标题方向：\"The Limits of Post-Hoc Contamination Calibration: An IRT-Based Diagnostic Study\"。\n  仍投 EMNLP：venue 明确欢迎 negative results。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SFT contamination injection on Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B at 5 dosage levels.\n      在 worst 档下，注入本身成功，但下游效果揭示 contamination 的非单调、benchmark-dependent 本质，\n      使得 calibration 的前提假设（\"contamination inflates scores\"）在多数 benchmark 上不成立。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_training_success_rate: 1.0\n      paraphrase_qc_pass_rate_mmlu: 0.47\n      paraphrase_qc_pass_rate_gsm8k: 0.173\n      paraphrase_qc_pass_rate_arc: 0.595\n      # 0.5B dose-response\n      mmlu_05B_d000: 0.398\n      mmlu_05B_d005: 0.326\n      mmlu_05B_d025: 0.280\n      mmlu_05B_d100: 0.233\n      arc_05B_d000: 0.469\n      arc_05B_d005: 0.329\n      arc_05B_d025: 0.320\n      arc_05B_d100: 0.294\n      gsm8k_05B_d000: 0.369\n      gsm8k_05B_d005: 0.362\n      gsm8k_05B_d025: 0.311\n      gsm8k_05B_d100: 0.365\n      # 1.5B dose-response — MC benchmarks immune\n      mmlu_15B_d000: 0.575\n      mmlu_15B_d005: 0.585\n      mmlu_15B_d025: 0.590\n      mmlu_15B_d100: 0.593\n      arc_15B_d000: 0.776\n      arc_15B_d005: 0.769\n      arc_15B_d025: 0.769\n      arc_15B_d100: 0.769\n      gsm8k_15B_d000: 0.637\n      gsm8k_15B_d005: 0.648\n      gsm8k_15B_d025: 0.654\n      gsm8k_15B_d100: 0.650\n      # 3B dose-response\n      mmlu_3B_d000: 0.630\n      mmlu_3B_d005: 0.634\n      mmlu_3B_d025: 0.621\n      mmlu_3B_d100: 0.632\n      arc_3B_d000: 0.818\n      arc_3B_d005: 0.829\n      arc_3B_d025: 0.811\n      arc_3B_d100: 0.824\n      gsm8k_3B_d000: 0.353\n      gsm8k_3B_d005: 0.208\n      gsm8k_3B_d025: 0.548\n      gsm8k_3B_d100: 0.742\n      cross_seed_std_mmlu: 0.015\n      cross_seed_std_arc: 0.025\n      cross_seed_std_gsm8k: 0.020\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT 注入本身是机械操作，成功率高。但 worst 档下暴露的关键问题：\n      (a) 0.5B 上 contamination 导致 MMLU 和 ARC 均下降而非上升——小模型容量不足，\n      将 paraphrase 纳入训练反而挤占有限参数空间导致 catastrophic forgetting（ARC -17pp 最极端）；\n      (b) 1.5B/3B 上 MC benchmark 几乎不受 dosage 影响（<2pp 变化），contamination 信号被模型容量吸收，\n      dose-response 曲线平坦，使得 γ 在这些 scale 上理论上就不可辨识；\n      (c) paraphrase QC pass rate 低（MMLU 47%，GSM8K 17%），意味着大量注入的 paraphrase 质量不够好，\n      模型可能学到的是 noisy reformulation 而非 memorization，削弱了 contamination 作为受控变量的内效度；\n      (d) GSM8K 3B d100 暴涨至 74.2% 是唯一明显的 inflation 信号，但这属于 open-ended task\n      在大模型上的特殊行为，与论文原始假设（MC benchmark inflation）方向不同。\n      整体上，dose-response 非单调、方向不一致，使得 \"calibration = subtract contamination effect\" 的前提崩塌。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Benchmark Accuracy by Scale × Dosage (mean ± std across 3 seeds)\"\n        columns: [Scale, Dosage, MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval]\n        rows:\n          - [0.5B, d000, \"0.398±0.013\", \"0.469±0.045\", \"0.369±0.013\", \"0.110±0.006\"]\n          - [0.5B, d005, \"0.326±0.018\", \"0.329±0.022\", \"0.362±0.004\", \"0.079±0.010\"]\n          - [0.5B, d025, \"0.280±0.012\", \"0.320±0.015\", \"0.311±0.030\", \"0.192±—\"]\n          - [0.5B, d100, \"0.233±0.037\", \"0.294±0.036\", \"0.365±0.011\", \"0.085±0.013\"]\n          - [1.5B, d000, \"0.576±0.001\", \"0.776±0.007\", \"0.637±0.003\", \"0.128±0.030\"]\n          - [1.5B, d005, \"0.585±—\", \"0.769±—\", \"0.648±—\", \"0.250±—\"]\n          - [1.5B, d025, \"0.590±—\", \"0.769±—\", \"0.654±—\", \"0.226±—\"]\n          - [1.5B, d100, \"0.593±0.002\", \"0.769±0.009\", \"0.650±0.004\", \"0.305±0.017\"]\n          - [3B, d000, \"0.630±0.005\", \"0.818±0.006\", \"0.353±0.120\", \"0.116±0.015\"]\n          - [3B, d005, \"0.634±—\", \"0.829±—\", \"0.208±—\", \"0.146±—\"]\n          - [3B, d025, \"0.621±—\", \"0.811±—\", \"0.548±—\", \"0.115±—\"]\n          - [3B, d100, \"0.632±0.007\", \"0.824±0.011\", \"0.742±0.030\", \"0.171±0.034\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Dose-response curves per benchmark×scale. 0.5B ARC/MMLU 显示负斜率（forgetting），1.5B/3B MC 平坦，GSM8K 3B 陡增。非单调性使 calibration 不可行。\"\n    analysis: >\n      worst 档下 exp-001 本身是 \"成功的\" 数据收集，但其结果恰恰证明了 calibration 的不可行性。\n      核心矛盾：contamination 效果是 benchmark-dependent、scale-dependent、direction-dependent 的，\n      不存在统一的 γ 来 \"subtract out\" 这些异质性效果。\n      这是论文 Part 3 (benchmark-dependent contamination effects) 的核心实证基础。\n      ARC catastrophic forgetting（0.5B d100 -17pp）和 GSM8K natural resistance\n      本身就是独立于方法是否 work 的有价值发现。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      Compute 4 detection signals on all contaminated + clean models.\n      Worst 档下：S1 是唯一在 0.5B d005 有效的信号，但在 1.5B/3B d005 也退化至 AUC<0.90；\n      S2 (Min-K++) 在所有条件下失败或反转；S3 (ConStat) 和 S4 (Self-Critique) 随机猜测水平。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B d005 within-model AUC\n      S1_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.953\n      S1_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.988\n      S1_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.995\n      S2_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.466\n      S2_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.465\n      S2_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.466\n      S3_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.52\n      S3_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.51\n      S3_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.53\n      S4_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.517\n      S4_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.495\n      S4_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.433\n      # 0.5B d100 cross-model Cohen's d\n      S1_05B_d100_cohens_d: 3.60\n      S2_05B_d100_cohens_d: -1.98\n      S4_05B_d100_cohens_d: 0.45\n      # 1.5B d005 — S1 退化\n      S1_15B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.82\n      S1_15B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.85\n      S1_15B_d005_arc_auc: 0.88\n      S2_15B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.49\n      S2_15B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.48\n      S2_15B_d005_arc_auc: 0.50\n      S4_15B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.51\n      S4_15B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.50\n      S4_15B_d005_arc_auc: 0.49\n      # 3B d005 — S1 进一步退化\n      S1_3B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.78\n      S1_3B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.80\n      S1_3B_d005_arc_auc: 0.83\n      S2_3B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.51\n      S2_3B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.50\n      S2_3B_d005_arc_auc: 0.52\n      S4_3B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.50\n      S4_3B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.49\n      S4_3B_d005_arc_auc: 0.48\n      effective_signals_at_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_at_15B: 0.5  # S1 marginal\n      effective_signals_at_3B: 0.3  # S1 below threshold\n    result_rationale: >\n      S1 (embedding similarity) 在 0.5B d005 强是因为小模型 embedding space 简单，paraphrase 和 original\n      的语义距离在低维空间中更易区分。随着模型规模增大，embedding space 维度和表征能力增加，\n      paraphrase 和 original 的 embedding 更加接近（更好的语义泛化），使得 S1 的区分力下降。\n      在 worst 档下，1.5B S1 AUC 降至 0.82-0.88（低于 exp-004 确定的 practical threshold 0.90），\n      3B 进一步降至 0.78-0.83。这意味着 S1 signal 的有效性严格受限于小模型，\n      在实际应用关切的较大模型上 S1 也不可靠。\n\n      S2 (Min-K++) 在 0.5B 上就已失败（AUC~0.47），且在 d100 时出现方向性反转（Cohen's d=-1.98），\n      这是因为 Min-K++ 依赖 token-level surprise：contaminated items 按假设应 less surprising，\n      但 0.5B 模型的 softmax 分布太平坦，contamination 反而通过 fine-tuning 改变了整体 calibration，\n      使 contaminated items 的 token probability 分布与 clean items 无法区分甚至反转。\n      这在更大模型上不会改善——larger models 有更好的 in-context learning 能力，\n      使得 fine-tuned memorization 和 in-context generalization 的信号更加纠缠。\n\n      S4 (Self-Critique) 依赖模型自我评估能力，0.5B 模型根本没有足够的 instruction-following\n      能力来可靠地进行 self-critique，因此 AUC 始终在 chance 水平。\n      在 1.5B/3B 上理论上应该改善，但 worst 档下假设 Self-Critique 对 SFT contamination\n      （而非 pre-training contamination）不敏感——SFT 改变的是 response distribution 而非\n      model's knowledge，Self-Critique 检测的是 knowledge discrepancy，因此无信号。\n\n      S3 (ConStat) 依赖 original vs paraphrase 的 performance gap，但 exp-001 已证明\n      1.5B/3B 上这个 gap <2pp（MC benchmarks immune），所以 ConStat 的 signal-to-noise ratio\n      接近 0，AUC 在 chance 水平。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Signal AUC Heatmap — d005 within-model detection\"\n        columns: [Signal, Scale, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC, Mean]\n        rows:\n          - [S1 (Embedding), 0.5B, 0.953, 0.988, 0.995, 0.979]\n          - [S1 (Embedding), 1.5B, 0.82, 0.85, 0.88, 0.85]\n          - [S1 (Embedding), 3B, 0.78, 0.80, 0.83, 0.80]\n          - [S2 (Min-K++), 0.5B, 0.466, 0.465, 0.466, 0.466]\n          - [S2 (Min-K++), 1.5B, 0.49, 0.48, 0.50, 0.49]\n          - [S2 (Min-K++), 3B, 0.51, 0.50, 0.52, 0.51]\n          - [S3 (ConStat), 0.5B, 0.52, 0.51, 0.53, 0.52]\n          - [S3 (ConStat), 1.5B, 0.50, 0.50, 0.51, 0.50]\n          - [S3 (ConStat), 3B, 0.49, 0.49, 0.50, 0.49]\n          - [S4 (Self-Critique), 0.5B, 0.517, 0.495, 0.433, 0.48]\n          - [S4 (Self-Critique), 1.5B, 0.51, 0.50, 0.49, 0.50]\n          - [S4 (Self-Critique), 3B, 0.50, 0.49, 0.48, 0.49]\n      - name: \"Table 3: d100 Cross-Model Cohen's d (0.5B)\"\n        columns: [Signal, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [S1, 3.82, 3.45, 3.53, \"Strong positive — correct direction\"]\n          - [S2, -2.11, -1.75, -2.08, \"Strong NEGATIVE — directional reversal\"]\n          - [S4, 0.52, 0.38, 0.45, \"Weak positive — near noise\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC heatmap. S1 shows clear scale degradation (green→yellow→orange as scale increases). S2-S4 uniformly red (chance level). Paper's Figure 2.\"\n    analysis: >\n      worst 档的核心发现：不存在跨 scale 可靠的检测信号。S1 在 0.5B 上的高 AUC (0.979)\n      是一个特殊条件下的结果，不能泛化到 1.5B/3B。这直接导致 Stage 2 IRT 的 exposure\n      输入质量在 1.5B/3B 上严重退化，使得 γ 估计变得 structurally unidentifiable。\n      Min-K++ 方向性反转 (Cohen's d = -1.98) 是论文最可引用的 cautionary finding——\n      reviewer 和社区需要知道这个信号不仅仅是 \"doesn't work\" 而是 \"actively misleads\"。\n      论文 Part 2 的核心贡献就是这个 signal failure mode characterization。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF fusion of 4 signals. Worst 档下：RRF 退化为 S1-only 模式，\n      因为其余 3 个信号贡献的是噪声而非信号，fusion 没有任何增益。\n    expected_results:\n      # RRF vs S1-only comparison (0.5B, per-item exposure correlation)\n      rrf_s1only_exposure_correlation: 0.97\n      rrf_vs_s1only_mae_gap: 0.005\n      rrf_vs_s1only_ranking_gap: 0.01\n      # Ablation: RRF vs single-signal (downstream MAE on calibrated scores)\n      rrf_4signal_mae: 0.078\n      s1_only_mae: 0.075\n      s2_only_mae: 0.145\n      s3_only_mae: 0.140\n      s4_only_mae: 0.138\n      rrf_2signal_closed_weight_mae: 0.142\n      # False positive injection robustness\n      fp_injection_5pct_mae_delta: 0.003\n      fp_injection_10pct_mae_delta: 0.008\n      fp_injection_20pct_mae_delta: 0.025\n      # 1.5B/3B: RRF = noise because even S1 degrades\n      rrf_15B_effective_auc: 0.80\n      rrf_3B_effective_auc: 0.75\n    result_rationale: >\n      当 3/4 信号在 chance level 时，RRF 的 rank fusion 本质上在把 noise ranks 和 signal ranks\n      混合。在 RRF 公式 score(d) = Σ 1/(k + rank_i(d)) 中，noise 信号的 rank 是随机排列，\n      其贡献是均匀分布的常数偏移，不改变 S1 的相对排序。因此 RRF ≈ S1-only\n      （exposure correlation 0.97），MAE gap 仅 0.005——在噪声范围内。\n\n      但 RRF 比 S1-only 略差而非略好，因为 noise signals 偶尔会把真正 high-exposure items\n      的 composite rank 拉向中间位置（rank dilution effect），引入微量 MAE 噪声。\n      这使得 RRF \"principled aggregation\" 的论证变成纯理论——在实际数据上没有 benefit。\n\n      Closed-weight 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) 更糟：两个 noise signals 的 fusion\n      仍然是 noise，MAE 接近 raw baseline（没有任何 calibration 效果）。\n\n      在 1.5B/3B 上，即使 S1 也退化，RRF 的 effective AUC 进一步降至 0.75-0.80，\n      低于 exp-004 确定的 practical identifiability threshold。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: RRF Ablation — Downstream Calibration MAE (0.5B, ARC)\"\n        columns: [Method, Exposure_AUC_equiv, MAE, Coverage_95, Kendall_tau]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF (4 signals), 0.82, 0.078, \"25%\", 0.62]\n          - [S1-only, 0.979, 0.075, \"25%\", 0.65]\n          - [S2-only, 0.47, 0.145, \"50%\", 0.30]\n          - [S3-only, 0.52, 0.140, \"55%\", 0.32]\n          - [S4-only, 0.48, 0.138, \"52%\", 0.28]\n          - [Closed-weight (S3+S4), 0.51, 0.142, \"53%\", 0.31]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: RRF vs S1-only item-level exposure scatter plot. Near-perfect correlation (r=0.97) confirms RRF degrades to dominant-signal mode.\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF 的 \"principled design choice\" 论证在 worst 档下变成：\n      \"we chose RRF to avoid meta-circularity; the cost is that when most signals fail,\n      it doesn't improve over the best individual signal, but it also doesn't degrade much.\"\n      这是一个 honest limitation，不是 contribution。论文 Discussion 中需要明确：\n      RRF 的价值是 architectural——当更好的 signals 可用时（future work），\n      framework 可以 seamlessly incorporate them。当前数据不支持 aggregation benefit claim。\n\n  - name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      144-condition synthetic sweep for identifiability. Worst 档下：sweep 揭示\n      N<50 + AUC<0.80 时 γ 结构性不可辨识。实际实验条件（N=8-16, AUC=0.75-0.85）\n      正好落在 unidentifiable zone 内。\n    expected_results:\n      # Completed conditions (actual data)\n      auc055_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.040\n      auc055_n20_coverage95: 0.80\n      auc055_n20_ci_width: 0.133\n      auc055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.026\n      auc055_n50_coverage95: 0.90\n      auc055_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.005\n      auc055_n100_coverage95: 1.00\n      auc080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.030\n      auc080_n50_ci_width: 0.163\n      auc080_n100_ci_width: 0.116\n      # Worst-tier predictions for missing conditions\n      auc065_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.055\n      auc065_n20_coverage95: 0.75\n      auc065_n20_ci_width: 0.175\n      auc065_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n      auc065_n50_coverage95: 0.85\n      auc065_n100_coverage95: 0.95\n      auc090_n20_ci_width: 0.320\n      auc090_n20_coverage95: 0.70\n      auc090_n50_ci_width: 0.207\n      auc090_n50_coverage95: 0.85\n      auc090_n100_ci_width: 0.145\n      # Critical finding: practical identifiability boundary\n      practical_threshold_auc: 0.80\n      practical_threshold_n: 50\n      ci_width_at_actual_conditions_n8_auc080: 0.42\n      ci_width_at_actual_conditions_n16_auc080: 0.30\n      ci_width_at_actual_conditions_n8_auc075: 0.48\n      # Fisher Information analysis\n      fisher_info_structural_identifiability_auc: 0.55\n      fisher_info_practical_identifiability_auc: 0.80\n      fisher_info_ci_width_floor_from_prior: 0.05\n      # Growing Pains pre-estimation\n      growing_pains_improvement_at_n20: 0.08  # CI width reduction\n      growing_pains_improvement_at_n50: 0.03\n      # AUC-CI width inflation paradox\n      ci_width_ratio_auc080_vs_auc055: 1.90\n    result_rationale: >\n      exp-004 已完成的数据（48/120 runs）确认了关键趋势：\n      (a) CI width 随 AUC 增大而非减小（1.87-1.95× inflation at AUC=0.80 vs 0.55），\n      这是 exposure-ability collinearity 的后果——更好的 exposure signal 意味着 exposure\n      更能预测 correctness，而 γ 需要区分 \"因为 exposed\" vs \"因为 able\"，两者越 collinear\n      越难分离；\n      (b) 1/√N scaling 成立但有常数项（prior variance floor），在小 N 时 prior 主导后验；\n      (c) N=20 时 coverage 仅 80%，远低于 nominal 95%。\n\n      在 worst 档下补充预测：\n      - AUC=0.65 条件可能因数值不稳定而系统性失败（v3-v5 已显示此模式），\n        即使部分成功也显示 CI width 在 N=20 时高达 0.175（>15pp），标记为 unidentifiable；\n      - AUC=0.90 条件下 CI width 进一步膨胀至 0.207-0.320（collinearity 更严重），\n        N=20 时覆盖率降至 70%；\n      - 推算到实际实验条件（N=8, AUC≈0.80）：CI width ≈ 0.42，即 γ 的 95% CI 宽度\n        为 ±21pp——无法区分 \"无污染\" 和 \"中等污染\"；\n      - 即使 pooling 到 N=16（multi-seed），CI width 仍 ≈ 0.30（±15pp），precision 不足\n        以支撑任何校准 claim；\n      - Fisher Information 分析给出 structural identifiability threshold AUC≥0.55\n        （参数唯一确定）但 practical identifiability threshold AUC≥0.80 + N≥50\n        （estimation quality sufficient for decisions）——当前条件远未达到 practical threshold。\n\n      这构成论文的 \"identifiability impossibility result\"：在现有信号质量和模型数量下，\n      γ 精确估计在理论上就不可行。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Identifiability Phase Diagram — CI Width by AUC × N\"\n        columns: [AUC, N=20, N=50, N=100, N=200]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.55\", \"0.133 ✓\", \"0.087 ✓\", \"0.064 ✓\", \"0.045 (pred)\"]\n          - [\"0.65\", \"0.175 ✗\", \"0.115 ✓\", \"0.082 ✓\", \"0.058 (pred)\"]\n          - [\"0.80\", \"0.258 ✗\", \"0.163 ✗\", \"0.116 ✓\", \"0.082 (pred)\"]\n          - [\"0.90\", \"0.320 ✗\", \"0.207 ✗\", \"0.145 ✗\", \"0.103 (pred)\"]\n        notes: \"✓ = CI width < 15pp (practical identifiability); ✗ = unidentifiable. Threshold: practical γ estimation requires ≤0.15 CI width.\"\n      - name: \"Table 6: Extrapolation to Actual Experimental Conditions\"\n        columns: [Condition, N_models, Signal_AUC, Predicted_CI_width, Verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.5B S1-only\", 8, 0.98, \"0.33\", \"Structurally identifiable but imprecise\"]\n          - [\"0.5B+1.5B pooled\", 16, 0.85, \"0.30\", \"Marginally identifiable\"]\n          - [\"1.5B S1-only\", 8, 0.85, \"0.45\", \"Unidentifiable\"]\n          - [\"3B S1-only\", 8, 0.80, \"0.48\", \"Unidentifiable\"]\n          - [\"Any scale, RRF\", 8, 0.75, \"0.52\", \"Unidentifiable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4 (paper): Identifiability phase diagram — AUC × N_models heatmap with CI width as color. Shaded region marks unidentifiable zone. Star markers show actual experimental conditions, all falling in or near unidentifiable zone.\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-004 在 worst 档下提供了论文最强的理论贡献：calibration 不 work 不是因为 implementation bug\n      或 prior choice，而是因为在 N<50 且 signal AUC<0.80 的条件下（这就是 LLM evaluation\n      的现实——你不会有 50+ 独立模型），γ 的后验精度根本不够支撑 calibration。\n      Fisher Info 分析形式化了这一点。\n      Reframe 为 \"impossibility result\" 后，这变成对社区的重要 warning：\n      \"don't try to calibrate with IRT unless you have >>50 models and AUC>>0.80 signals\"。\n      这是负面结果中最有理论深度的部分。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      Measurement error model for exposure noise. Worst 档下：ME model 对 coverage 无改善，\n      CI 对 σ_e 不敏感，噪声传播在 IRT 框架内被 prior 吸收。\n    expected_results:\n      # ME model results (from actual data)\n      me_model_converged: true\n      me_ci_width_range: [0.0997, 0.1000]\n      me_ci_monotonicity_rho: 0.4\n      me_ci_monotonicity_p: 0.5\n      me_coverage_95_improvement_vs_point: 0.0\n      # Post-hoc noise injection\n      noise_1x_gamma_shift: 0.02\n      noise_1x_ci_widening: 0.005\n      noise_15x_gamma_shift: 0.04\n      noise_15x_ci_widening: 0.008\n      noise_2x_gamma_shift: 0.07\n      noise_2x_ci_widening: 0.012\n      # Coverage with ME model\n      me_coverage_95_arc: 0.20\n      me_coverage_95_gsm8k: 0.30\n      me_coverage_80_arc: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      ME model 的 CI 对 σ_e 不敏感（range 仅 0.0997-0.1000）是因为：\n      (a) Bayesian posterior 在 N 很小时被 prior 主导，noise 信息被 prior 的 regularization 淹没；\n      (b) ME model 中 exposure_ij ~ N(τ_ij, σ_e²) 的 σ_e 被当作 known constant\n      而非 estimated parameter，所以它只影响 likelihood 的 weighting 而非 posterior 的 spread；\n      (c) 更本质地，coverage gap 的根因不是 exposure noise，而是 local independence violation\n      和 N 不足——ME model 解决的是错误的问题。\n\n      Post-hoc noise injection 也只产生微弱效果（CI widening < 1.2pp at 2× noise），\n      进一步证实 noise propagation 不是 coverage 的瓶颈。\n\n      worst 档下，ME model 对论文的贡献降级为 appendix 中的 null result：\n      \"we tried propagating detection noise; it didn't help because the coverage problem\n      is structural (local independence + small N), not measurement-error-driven.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Measurement Error Model — CI Width vs σ_e\"\n        columns: [σ_e, CI_width_gamma, CI_width_theta, Coverage_95, Δ_vs_point_estimate]\n        rows:\n          - [0.0 (point), 0.100, 0.15, \"25%\", \"—\"]\n          - [0.1, 0.0997, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [0.3, 0.0998, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [0.5, 0.0999, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [1.0, 0.1000, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ME model 是 Claim 3 (uncertainty propagation) 的核心实验，在 worst 档下完全失败。\n      论文中 Claim 3 需要被大幅削弱或合并到 exp-004 的 identifiability discussion 中。\n      不再 claim \"ContamCal explicitly propagates detection signal noise\"，\n      改为 \"detection noise is not the binding constraint; sample size and model misspecification are.\"\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      Fit 4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS) on controlled models. 核心 calibration 实验。\n      Worst 档下：MMLU 不收敛不可报告，GSM8K/ARC 在真实信号条件下 γ CI 包含 0，\n      所有条件下 MAE 不优于 raw baseline，coverage 崩塌至 18-33%。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU — fit failure\n      mmlu_perbench_rhat: 1.54\n      mmlu_perbench_ess: 7\n      mmlu_perbench_gamma: -3.81\n      mmlu_perbench_gamma_ci: [-7.02, 3.22]\n      mmlu_joint_rhat: 1.08\n      mmlu_joint_ess: 85\n      mmlu_reportable: false\n      # GSM8K — oracle significant, real signal not\n      gsm8k_oracle_gamma: 3.773\n      gsm8k_oracle_gamma_ci: [2.741, 4.714]\n      gsm8k_oracle_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      gsm8k_oracle_rhat: 1.002\n      gsm8k_oracle_mae: 0.092\n      gsm8k_oracle_coverage_95: 0.31\n      gsm8k_oracle_ppp: 0.0\n      gsm8k_s1only_gamma: 0.187\n      gsm8k_s1only_gamma_ci: [-0.917, 1.329]\n      gsm8k_s1only_gamma_excludes_zero: false\n      gsm8k_s1only_rhat: 1.015\n      gsm8k_s1only_ess: 330\n      gsm8k_s1only_mae: 0.037\n      gsm8k_s1only_coverage_95: 0.50\n      gsm8k_s1only_ppp: 0.336\n      gsm8k_rrf_gamma: 0.12\n      gsm8k_rrf_gamma_ci: [-0.74, 0.96]\n      gsm8k_rrf_gamma_excludes_zero: false\n      # ARC — oracle marginal, real signal significant but calibration bad\n      arc_oracle_gamma: -2.83\n      arc_oracle_gamma_ci: [-4.10, -1.56]\n      arc_oracle_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_oracle_mae: 0.076\n      arc_oracle_coverage_95: 0.18\n      arc_oracle_ppp: 1.0\n      arc_s1only_gamma: -1.464\n      arc_s1only_gamma_ci: [-2.51, -0.41]\n      arc_s1only_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_s1only_mae: 0.035\n      arc_s1only_coverage_95: 0.625\n      arc_s1only_ppp: 0.968\n      arc_s1only_kendall_tau: 0.756\n      arc_rrf_gamma: -2.347\n      arc_rrf_gamma_ci: [-3.46, -1.19]\n      arc_rrf_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_rrf_mae: 0.035\n      arc_rrf_coverage_95: 0.625\n      # Baselines (ARC, N=8)\n      arc_B0_raw_mae: 0.059\n      arc_B1_remove_rescore_mae: 0.059\n      arc_B2_2pl_gamma_mae: 0.064\n      arc_B3_vanilla_4pl_mae: 0.071\n      arc_B4_linear_regression_mae: 0.056\n      arc_B5_emperor_mae: 0.059\n      arc_B6_dcr_fuzzy_mae: 0.245\n      # Baselines (GSM8K, N=8)\n      gsm8k_B0_raw_mae: 0.003\n      gsm8k_B4_linear_mae: 0.003\n      gsm8k_B3_vanilla_4pl_mae: 0.012\n      gsm8k_B6_dcr_fuzzy_mae: 0.263\n      # Key summary metrics for worst tier\n      gamma_significance_rate: 0.08  # 1/12 benchmark×signal combinations\n      mae_vs_raw_delta: 0.035  # IRT MAE minus raw MAE (positive = worse)\n      coverage_95_mean: 0.28\n      kendall_tau_mean: 0.52\n      ppp_range: [0.0, 1.0]  # both extremes indicate misspecification\n    result_rationale: >\n      MMLU 不收敛（rhat=1.54, ESS=7）的原因：\n      (a) 14042 items 的 MMLU 在 NUTS 中计算量巨大，subsample 到 1000 items 时\n      失去了 per-item parameter 的稳定性；\n      (b) MMLU 的 contamination effect 极微弱（1.5B/3B <2pp），在 0.5B 上是负方向，\n      NUTS 在搜索后验时无法找到 γ 的 stable mode；\n      (c) 3B 也出现类似问题——rhat=1.08, ESS=85——说明这不是 0.5B 特有的。\n      结论：MMLU 结果不可报告。\n\n      GSM8K oracle γ=3.77 显著（CI [2.74, 4.71]）但 MAE=0.092 远差于 raw baseline\n      MAE=0.003。这是因为 GSM8K 本身不受 contamination 影响（自然抗性），\n      raw scores 已经接近 ground truth，任何 \"calibration\" 都是在 add noise 而非 remove bias。\n      oracle γ 显著只是因为 oracle 使用 ground-truth dosage，IRT 能 fit 一个统计显著的\n      关联，但这个关联没有 practical utility——calibrated score 比 raw score 差 9pp。\n      在真实信号（S1-only）条件下，γ=0.19 不显著（CI 包含 0），\n      因为 S1 signal 与 GSM8K contamination 无关联（open-ended task 天然抗 memorization）。\n\n      ARC 是唯一 \"partially working\" 的 benchmark：S1-only γ=-1.46 显著（CI 排除 0），\n      MAE=0.035 优于 raw MAE=0.059。但 coverage 仅 62.5%（N=8 only 5 models covered），\n      且 PPP=0.97 表明 severe misspecification——模型预测的 item response pattern\n      与观测数据严重不符。在 worst 档下，如果增加 multi-seed 到 N=16，\n      coverage 可能仍不改善（exp-004 显示 N=20 AUC=0.80 时 coverage 也仅 90%），\n      而 PPP 极端值（ARC=1.0, GSM8K=0.0）表明 additive γ 模型根本不适合\n      这些 benchmark 的 contamination structure。\n\n      综合：γ 显著率 ~8%（12 个 benchmark×signal 组合中仅 ARC×S1 一个），\n      calibration 从不优于 raw baseline（除 ARC 略好但 coverage 崩塌），\n      \"calibration\" 这个 claim 完全不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: IRT 4PL+γ Calibration Results (per-benchmark fitting)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, Signal, γ, \"γ CI\", \"Excl. 0?\", rhat, MAE, \"Raw MAE\", Coverage_95, PPP]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, oracle, -3.81, \"[-7.02, 3.22]\", No, 1.54, \"—\", 0.099, \"—\", 0.75]\n          - [MMLU, S1-only, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \">1.1\", \"—\", 0.099, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [MMLU, RRF, -0.21, \"[-1.01, 0.59]\", No, 1.08, \"—\", 0.099, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [GSM8K, oracle, 3.77, \"[2.74, 4.71]\", Yes, 1.002, 0.092, 0.003, \"31%\", 0.0]\n          - [GSM8K, S1-only, 0.19, \"[-0.92, 1.33]\", No, 1.015, 0.037, 0.003, \"50%\", 0.34]\n          - [GSM8K, RRF, 0.12, \"[-0.74, 0.96]\", No, 1.015, 0.036, 0.003, \"50%\", 0.34]\n          - [ARC, oracle, -2.83, \"[-4.10, -1.56]\", Yes, 1.006, 0.076, 0.059, \"18%\", 1.0]\n          - [ARC, S1-only, -1.46, \"[-2.51, -0.41]\", Yes, 1.010, 0.035, 0.059, \"63%\", 0.97]\n          - [ARC, RRF, -2.35, \"[-3.46, -1.19]\", Yes, 1.008, 0.035, 0.059, \"63%\", 1.0]\n      - name: \"Table 9: Baseline Comparison (ARC, N=8 models)\"\n        columns: [Method, MAE, Coverage_95, Sharpness, Kendall_tau]\n        rows:\n          - [\"B0: Raw (no adjustment)\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\", 0.800]\n          - [\"B1: Remove-and-rescore\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\", 0.800]\n          - [\"B2: Single-signal 2PL+γ\", 0.064, \"—\", \"—\", 0.690]\n          - [\"B3: Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\", 0.071, \"—\", \"—\", 0.650]\n          - [\"B4: Linear regression\", 0.056, \"87.5%\", \"0.12\", 0.756]\n          - [\"B5: Emperor's mitigation\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\", 0.780]\n          - [\"B6: DCR fuzzy\", 0.245, \"37.5%\", \"0.05\", 0.378]\n          - [\"IRT 4PL+γ (ours)\", 0.035, \"62.5%\", \"0.068\", 0.756]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5 (paper): Calibrated-vs-true accuracy scatter with CIs. ARC shows IRT points closer to diagonal but CIs miss true values for 3/8 models. GSM8K shows IRT adds noise to already-good raw scores. MMLU absent (fit failed).\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-006 是论文 Claim 1 (calibration) 的决定性实验。在 worst 档下：\n      - MMLU 不可报告 → 论文丢失 primary benchmark\n      - GSM8K γ 不显著 + MAE 比 raw 差 → negative control 确认，但 \"calibration works\" 无据\n      - ARC γ 显著且 MAE 改善 → 唯一正面结果，但 coverage 62.5% + PPP 极端 → 模型 misspecified\n      - Linear regression (B4) 在 coverage (87.5%) 上远优于 IRT (62.5%)，且 MAE 仅差 2pp → \n        reviewer 会问 \"why use IRT at all when linear regression works better?\"\n      这使得 calibration claim 完全不可持续。论文 reframe 为 \"why calibration fails\"\n      并指出 structural reasons (N, local independence, signal quality)。\n\n  - name: sft_d100_qc_only\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      100% dosage SFT using only QC-pass paraphrases. Isolates noisy contamination confound.\n      Worst 档下：QC-only 结果与 full d100 几乎无差异，说明 paraphrase quality\n      不是 calibration 失败的原因。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_d100_qc_only: 0.240\n      arc_d100_qc_only: 0.285\n      gsm8k_d100_qc_only: 0.360\n      mmlu_delta_vs_full_d100: 0.008\n      arc_delta_vs_full_d100: -0.009\n      gsm8k_delta_vs_full_d100: -0.005\n      qc_items_used: 7547\n      total_items_available: 16697\n    result_rationale: >\n      QC-only 使用 7547 个通过质量检验的 paraphrase（占 45%），移除了 cosine similarity\n      低于 0.85 或 BLEU 高于 0.3 的 noisy paraphrase。但在 worst 档下，\n      clean vs noisy paraphrase 的差异可以忽略（<1pp），因为：\n      (a) 0.5B 模型的 catastrophic forgetting 是由训练数据量引起的（d100 增加了 ~5K extra items\n      到 training set），而非 paraphrase 质量——即使 paraphrase 都是 perfect semantic copies，\n      额外训练数据仍会挤占有限容量；\n      (b) 模型太小，无法区分 high-quality 和 low-quality paraphrase——\n      两者在 0.5B 模型看来都是 \"新的训练 examples\"，效果相同；\n      (c) 这排除了 \"noisy contamination confound\" 作为 calibration 失败的 alibi，\n      把注意力引回 structural causes。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-015 作为 orphaned experiment，在 worst 档下的价值是排除了一个 potential alibi：\n      \"calibration 之所以失败是因为 paraphrase quality 不够好\"。QC-only 结果证明\n      即使用最高质量的 paraphrase，结果也一样——问题出在 framework 本身，不是数据质量。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels.\n      Worst 档下：7B 上 MC benchmarks 完全免疫于 contamination，MMLU IRT 同样不收敛，\n      S1 signal 进一步退化。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_7B_d000: 0.715\n      mmlu_7B_d005: 0.717\n      mmlu_7B_d025: 0.718\n      mmlu_7B_d100: 0.720\n      arc_7B_d000: 0.870\n      arc_7B_d005: 0.872\n      arc_7B_d025: 0.871\n      arc_7B_d100: 0.873\n      gsm8k_7B_d000: 0.780\n      gsm8k_7B_d005: 0.782\n      gsm8k_7B_d025: 0.785\n      gsm8k_7B_d100: 0.790\n      humaneval_7B_d000: 0.350\n      humaneval_7B_d100: 0.420\n      max_dosage_effect_mc: 0.005  # <0.5pp on any MC benchmark\n      S1_7B_d005_auc: 0.72\n      mmlu_irt_7B_rhat: 1.12\n      mmlu_irt_7B_reportable: false\n      arc_irt_7B_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      gsm8k_irt_7B_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B 模型有足够的参数容量吸收 SFT contamination 而不影响 benchmark performance。\n      在 1.5B 上已经观察到 MC benchmarks 几乎不受 contamination 影响（<1pp），\n      7B 会进一步压平 dose-response 曲线至 noise level（<0.5pp）。\n      原因：larger models 的 LoRA rank 16 只改变了参数的极小比例（7B 的 16/7000M ≈ 0.0002%），\n      contaminated examples 的信号被 pre-training knowledge 稀释。\n\n      S1 signal 在 7B 上 AUC 降至 0.72：embedding space 更加丰富，\n      paraphrase 和 original 的语义表征更接近（更好的泛化 = 更难检测）。\n      这使得 exp-004 的 identifiability impossibility result 在 7B scale 上更加严峻：\n      AUC=0.72 + N≤8 → CI width > 0.5 → completely unidentifiable。\n\n      MMLU IRT 不收敛（rhat=1.12）与 0.5B/3B 一致——不是 scale-specific 问题，\n      而是 MMLU 的 item structure 与 4PL IRT 在 small-N regime 下不兼容。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: 7B Dose-Response (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d005, d025, d100, \"Max Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.715, 0.717, 0.718, 0.720, \"+0.5pp\"]\n          - [ARC, 0.870, 0.872, 0.871, 0.873, \"+0.3pp\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.780, 0.782, 0.785, 0.790, \"+1.0pp\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.350, 0.370, 0.395, 0.420, \"+7.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Supplement: 7B dose-response curves appended to Figure 1. MC benchmarks 完全平坦，HumanEval 仍有 dose-response。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B 数据在 worst 档下强化了论文的核心 negative message：\n      contamination calibration 在大模型上更不可行（effect size 趋向 0 + signal quality 下降），\n      而在小模型上虽然 effect size 大但方向不一致（forgetting vs inflation）。\n      IRT calibration 在任何 scale 上都没有 practical utility。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      Systematic evaluation of detection signal reliability across scales and regimes.\n      Worst 档下：S1 在 1.5B/3B d005 也退化至 AUC<0.90，\n      所有信号在 Instruct/RL 模型上完全失效。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B results (actual data)\n      S1_05B_d005_auc_mean: 0.979\n      S2_05B_d005_auc_mean: 0.465\n      S4_05B_d005_auc_mean: 0.481\n      S1_05B_d100_cross_cohens_d: 3.60\n      S2_05B_d100_cross_cohens_d: -1.98\n      S4_05B_d100_cross_cohens_d: 0.45\n      effective_signals_at_05B: 1\n      # 1.5B predictions (worst tier)\n      S1_15B_d005_auc_mean: 0.84\n      S2_15B_d005_auc_mean: 0.49\n      S4_15B_d005_auc_mean: 0.50\n      effective_signals_at_15B: 0\n      # 3B predictions (worst tier)\n      S1_3B_d005_auc_mean: 0.80\n      S2_3B_d005_auc_mean: 0.51\n      S4_3B_d005_auc_mean: 0.49\n      effective_signals_at_3B: 0\n      # Instruct/RL proxy\n      S1_05B_instruct_d005_auc: 0.52\n      S2_05B_instruct_d005_auc: 0.48\n      S4_05B_instruct_d005_auc: 0.47\n      signals_surviving_instruct: 0\n      # Min-K++ reversal (key finding)\n      minkpp_reversal_cohens_d_mmlu: -2.11\n      minkpp_reversal_cohens_d_gsm8k: -1.75\n      minkpp_reversal_cohens_d_arc: -2.08\n      minkpp_reversal_consistent_across_benchmarks: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      S1 (embedding) d005 AUC 在 1.5B/3B 退化的机制：\n      更大模型的 sentence embedding space 学到更好的语义泛化，\n      使 paraphrase 和 original 的 embedding 更接近。0.5B 模型 embedding space\n      相对 \"粗糙\"，paraphrase 和 original 落在不同的 local regions（AUC=0.98），\n      但 1.5B/3B 的 embedding 足以 \"理解\" paraphrase 是同一问题的另一种表述（AUC 降至 0.80-0.84）。\n      这不是 S1 的 bug——这是更好的语言理解与检测之间的根本矛盾。\n\n      S2/S4 在所有 scale 都在 chance level：\n      - S2 (Min-K++) 的 token-level surprise 在 LoRA fine-tuning 后没有系统性变化——\n        LoRA 修改的参数太少（rank 16）不足以改变 token probability distribution\n        到 Min-K++ 可检测的程度。d100 的方向性反转（Cohen's d=-1.98）是因为\n        contaminated training 微调了模型的 overall calibration（average token entropy 变化），\n        使 contaminated items 看起来 MORE surprising（反直觉）。\n      - S4 (Self-Critique) 需要 instruction-following 能力，SFT models 的 self-critique\n        能力不稳定，尤其是在被 contamination SFT 微调后 critique 能力可能被进一步破坏。\n\n      Instruct/RL proxy 全部信号失效（AUC≈0.50）：\n      Instruct 模型经过 RLHF/DPO 后，response distribution 完全改变，\n      所有基于 pre-training/SFT 阶段的信号（embedding similarity, token surprise,\n      performance gap, self-critique）都不再有效。RL 相当于在信号上叠加了巨大的噪声。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Signal Survival Heatmap — d005 AUC by Scale\"\n        columns: [Signal, 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, \"Instruct 0.5B\", Verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 (Embedding)\", \"0.979 ✓\", \"0.84 ✗\", \"0.80 ✗\", \"0.52 ✗\", \"0.5B-only\"]\n          - [\"S2 (Min-K++)\", \"0.465 ✗\", \"0.49 ✗\", \"0.51 ✗\", \"0.48 ✗\", \"Never works\"]\n          - [\"S4 (Self-Critique)\", \"0.481 ✗\", \"0.50 ✗\", \"0.49 ✗\", \"0.47 ✗\", \"Never works\"]\n        notes: \"✓ = AUC > 0.90 (practical threshold); ✗ = AUC < 0.90\"\n      - name: \"Table 12: Min-K++ Directional Reversal at d100 (0.5B)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, \"Cohen's d\", Direction, \"Expected Direction\", Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, -2.11, \"Contaminated looks MORE surprising\", Less surprising, \"Active misleading\"]\n          - [GSM8K, -1.75, \"Contaminated looks MORE surprising\", Less surprising, \"Active misleading\"]\n          - [ARC, -2.08, \"Contaminated looks MORE surprising\", Less surprising, \"Active misleading\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (paper): Signal × Scale AUC heatmap. S1 column shows green (0.5B) → orange (1.5B) → red (3B) gradient. S2/S4 uniformly red. This is the paper's most visually striking finding.\"\n      - \"Figure (supplement): Min-K++ score distributions for d000 vs d100, showing the reversal — contaminated distribution shifted RIGHT (higher surprise), opposite to theoretical expectation.\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-008 在 worst 档下提供论文 Part 2 的全部内容：\n      (a) 没有任何信号在所有 scale 上 survive（S1 仅限 0.5B）；\n      (b) Min-K++ 方向性反转是最引人注目的 cautionary finding——\n      如果社区依赖 Min-K++ 检测 contamination，他们可能会得到完全相反的结论；\n      (c) Instruct/RL 模型使所有信号失效，这对 \"real-world contamination detection\" \n      是致命打击——实际部署的模型都经过 RLHF，我们的检测工具对它们无效。\n\n  - name: multi_family_validation\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Controlled SFT injection on Llama-3.2-1B or Pythia-1.4B.\n      Worst 档下：其他 model family 表现出类似的失败模式，\n      确认 negative results 不是 Qwen-specific。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_1b_d000_mmlu: 0.32\n      llama_1b_d000_arc: 0.42\n      llama_1b_d000_gsm8k: 0.15\n      llama_1b_d025_mmlu: 0.30\n      llama_1b_d025_arc: 0.39\n      llama_1b_d025_gsm8k: 0.14\n      llama_1b_d100_mmlu: 0.27\n      llama_1b_d100_arc: 0.35\n      llama_1b_d100_gsm8k: 0.16\n      llama_1b_arc_delta_d100: -0.07  # forgetting but less severe than Qwen 0.5B\n      llama_S1_d005_auc: 0.91\n      llama_S2_d005_auc: 0.50\n      llama_irt_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      llama_irt_coverage_95: 0.25\n      cross_family_gamma_correlation: 0.45  # weak, not the r=0.91 hoped for\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B 在类似 scale (1B vs 0.5B) 下会展示类似的 catastrophic forgetting\n      pattern（ARC -7pp，比 Qwen 0.5B 的 -17pp 小因为 Llama 基础能力不同），\n      但方向一致（negative gamma for ARC）。\n\n      MMLU/GSM8K dose-response 同样平坦（small model absorbs contamination differently）。\n      S1 AUC 可能略好于 Qwen 0.5B（Llama 的 embedding space 不同），\n      但仍不足以使 IRT γ CI 排除 0（N 太小 + AUC 不够高）。\n\n      cross-family γ correlation 仅 0.45（而非希望的 0.91），因为\n      contamination effect 不是 benchmark property alone——它是\n      benchmark × model architecture × model scale 的交互效应。\n      这进一步削弱了 \"per-benchmark γ_k as benchmark property\" 的 claim。\n\n      在 worst 档下，exp-014 的价值是确认负面结果的 generalizability：\n      \"it's not just Qwen——calibration fails for Llama too.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Multi-Family Validation (Llama-3.2-1B)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d025, d100, \"Δ(d100-d000)\", \"Qwen 0.5B Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.32, 0.30, 0.27, \"-5pp\", \"-16pp\"]\n          - [ARC, 0.42, 0.39, 0.35, \"-7pp\", \"-17pp\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.15, 0.14, 0.16, \"+1pp\", \"~0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Supplement: Llama vs Qwen dose-response comparison. Both show ARC forgetting, but magnitude differs — contamination effect is family-dependent, weakening per-benchmark γ_k as universal parameter.\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-014 在 worst 档下排除了 \"Qwen-specific artifact\" 的 reviewer concern，\n      但代价是揭示了更深层的问题：contamination effect 的 magnitude 是 model-family-dependent，\n      使得 IRT 的 γ_k 不能被视为 benchmark 的 intrinsic property。\n      这进一步削弱了方法的 generalizability claim。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      Apply signals to existing RL-trained models (Instruct series, DeepSeek-R1).\n      Worst 档下：所有信号失效，CIs 极宽，expected regret 无改善。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal quality on RL models\n      S1_qwen_instruct_05B_auc: 0.52\n      S1_qwen_instruct_15B_auc: 0.50\n      S1_qwen_instruct_3B_auc: 0.51\n      S1_qwen_instruct_7B_auc: 0.49\n      S1_deepseek_r1_15B_auc: 0.48\n      S1_deepseek_r1_7B_auc: 0.50\n      all_signals_rl_auc_range: [0.45, 0.55]\n      # IRT fitting on RL models\n      irt_rl_gamma_ci_width: 0.85\n      irt_rl_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      irt_rl_coverage_95: 0.95  # trivially high because CIs are extremely wide\n      irt_rl_sharpness: 0.42  # useless CIs\n      # Expected regret\n      regret_uncalibrated: 0.12\n      regret_calibrated: 0.13\n      regret_remove_rescore: 0.11\n      regret_improvement: -0.01  # calibrated slightly WORSE\n      # Specificity check\n      near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark: true\n      near_zero_gamma_value: 0.05\n      near_zero_gamma_ci: [-0.40, 0.50]\n    result_rationale: >\n      RL/RLHF post-training 完全破坏了所有检测信号：\n      (a) embedding space 被 RLHF 重塑——reward model optimization 改变了 hidden representations\n      的 geometry，使 pre-training 时的 contamination traces 在 embedding 中不再可识别；\n      (b) token probability distribution 被 RLHF 剧烈改变（更 \"aligned\"），\n      Min-K++ 的 token surprise 完全失效；\n      (c) Self-Critique 在 Instruct 模型上可能略好（instruction-following 能力强），\n      但 RLHF 对 self-evaluation 的 calibration 也发生了改变。\n\n      当所有信号 AUC≈0.50 时，IRT exposure score 是纯噪声，\n      γ posterior 完全由 prior 决定（CI width = 0.85），coverage 95% 只是因为 CI 宽到\n      包含一切（sharpness = 0.42，即 ±21pp 的 CI 没有任何信息量）。\n\n      Expected regret analysis：uncalibrated 和 calibrated 的 top-5 model selection\n      几乎相同（regret gap =-0.01），因为 calibrated scores 是 raw scores + noise，\n      model ranking 保持原样。remove-and-rescore 略好只因它 drops items\n      从而 reduces variance，但也不显著。\n\n      Near-zero γ specificity check 通过（clean benchmark 上 γ≈0.05, CI 包含 0），\n      但这是一个 trivial result——当信号是噪声时，γ 自然接近 prior mean (0)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: RL Observational Study — Signal AUC\"\n        columns: [Model, S1, S2, S4, \"Any signal > 0.60?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, 0.52, 0.48, 0.47, No]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 0.50, 0.49, 0.50, No]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, 0.51, 0.50, 0.49, No]\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 0.49, 0.51, 0.50, No]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B, 0.48, 0.47, 0.50, No]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B, 0.50, 0.50, 0.49, No]\n      - name: \"Table 15: Expected Regret — Top-5 Model Selection\"\n        columns: [Method, \"Regret (MAE vs oracle ranking)\", \"Δ vs Raw\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Raw (uncalibrated), 0.12, \"—\"]\n          - [ContamCal (calibrated), 0.13, \"+0.01 (worse)\"]\n          - [Remove-and-rescore, 0.11, \"-0.01\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-009 在 worst 档下给出论文 Limitations 的核心内容：\n      \"ContamCal's calibration is only as good as its input signals.\n      For RL-post-trained models — which constitute the majority of deployed LLMs — \n      all available detection signals fail, rendering calibration uninformative.\"\n      这是一个 honest limitation 而非隐藏的 failure。\n      论文 framing：calibration 需要 reliable detection，而 reliable detection\n      目前仅限于 SFT-stage 小模型——这本身是对社区的 important message。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only).\n      Worst 档下：frontier model 上信号全部失效，只能做定性分析。\n    expected_results:\n      S1_72B_auc: 0.50\n      S2_72B_auc: 0.51\n      S4_72B_auc: 0.49\n      irt_gamma_ci_width: 0.90\n      irt_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      qualitative_contamination_evidence: \"none detectable\"\n      mmlu_72B_accuracy: 0.845\n      arc_72B_accuracy: 0.920\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 模型在所有信号维度上都在 chance level：\n      (a) embedding space 极其高维和复杂，paraphrase/original 区分无意义；\n      (b) 72B 的 in-context learning 能力意味着即使没有 memorization，\n      模型也能 \"理解\" 测试题的结构并正确回答，使 memorization signal 不可区分于 capability；\n      (c) 72B pre-training data 极大，contamination 的 marginal effect 极小\n      （即使测试集在训练集中，它只占训练数据的 < 0.001%）。\n\n      IRT fitting 在 single-model inference 下只有 1 个 \"examinee\"，\n      无法估计 person parameters，只能做 item-level analysis——\n      但 item parameters 也需要多个 examinees 才能稳定估计。\n      结果是 γ 的 CI 极宽（0.90），完全无信息量。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-012 在 worst 档下仅作为 Limitations 中的 \"scaling limit\" 证据：\n      \"at frontier scales (72B), all detection signals are at chance level,\n      confirming that post-hoc contamination calibration cannot currently operate\n      at the scales most relevant to the community.\"\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight models.\n      Worst 档下：2-signal ≈ noise，calibration 完全失效。\n    expected_results:\n      constat_auc_05B: 0.52\n      selfcritique_auc_05B: 0.48\n      rrf_2signal_effective_auc: 0.50\n      irt_2signal_gamma_ci_width: 0.95\n      irt_2signal_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      irt_2signal_mae: 0.140\n      irt_2signal_coverage_95: 0.95  # trivially high, CIs are entire range\n      irt_2signal_vs_4signal_mae_gap: 0.062\n      irt_2signal_vs_raw_mae_gap: 0.081  # much worse than raw\n    result_rationale: >\n      ConStat 和 Self-Critique 在 0.5B 上的 AUC 都在 chance level（0.48-0.52），\n      它们的 RRF fusion 仍然是 noise（effective AUC ≈ 0.50）。\n      IRT 接收到的 exposure scores 是纯随机排序，\n      γ posterior 完全退化到 prior（CI width = 0.95）。\n\n      Calibrated scores 比 raw scores 差 8pp MAE（0.140 vs 0.059），\n      因为 noise exposure 在 calibration 公式中引入了 systematic error。\n      Coverage 95% 但 sharpness 接近 0（CIs 太宽没有信息量）。\n\n      这在 worst 档下完全排除了 closed-weight applicability：\n      对于 GPT-4, Claude 等 closed-weight models，ContamCal 没有任何适用性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration (0.5B, ARC)\"\n        columns: [Mode, \"Effective AUC\", MAE, Coverage_95, Sharpness]\n        rows:\n          - [\"4-signal RRF\", 0.82, 0.078, \"25%\", 0.12]\n          - [\"S1-only\", 0.979, 0.035, \"63%\", 0.068]\n          - [\"2-signal (closed-weight)\", 0.50, 0.140, \"95%\", 0.45]\n          - [\"Raw (no adjustment)\", \"—\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-013 在 worst 档下给出论文 Limitations 的 closed-weight 段：\n      \"For closed-weight models where only ConStat and Self-Critique are applicable,\n      calibration degrades below the raw baseline. This limits ContamCal's applicability\n      to open-weight models where embedding-based signals are available.\"\n      这是 honest but damaging limitation，reviewer 会 note 这严重限制了 practical impact。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8891,"cache_read_input_tokens":44655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8891},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"656feef8-1f1e-423a-a936-6b6196c229f5","uuid":"e7dc21a3-cebf-477a-a535-821375a802b1"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":615489,"duration_api_ms":616127,"num_turns":4,"result":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the project state. Here are the worst-tier predictions for every experiment in the plan.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  论文彻底放弃 calibration claim。Reframe 为三部分负面结果贡献：\n  (1) \"Why contamination calibration is harder than it looks\" — 系统性展示 IRT+γ 在 LLM 评估中失败的结构性原因\n  (N 不足、local independence 违反、信号质量不够），对社区的 warning；\n  (2) Signal failure mode characterization — Min-K++ 方向性反转 (Cohen's d=-1.98) 是最可引用的发现，\n  S1 作为唯一可靠信号的实证、d100 标签退化的解释；\n  (3) Benchmark-dependent contamination effects — ARC 灾难性遗忘 vs GSM8K 天然抗性 vs MMLU 微弱效应，\n  作为 empirical finding 独立于方法是否 work。\n  Fisher Info 分析 reframe 为 identifiability impossibility result。\n  标题方向：\"The Limits of Post-Hoc Contamination Calibration: An IRT-Based Diagnostic Study\"。\n  仍投 EMNLP：venue 明确欢迎 negative results。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SFT contamination injection on Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B at 5 dosage levels.\n      在 worst 档下，注入本身成功，但下游效果揭示 contamination 的非单调、benchmark-dependent 本质，\n      使得 calibration 的前提假设（\"contamination inflates scores\"）在多数 benchmark 上不成立。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_training_success_rate: 1.0\n      paraphrase_qc_pass_rate_mmlu: 0.47\n      paraphrase_qc_pass_rate_gsm8k: 0.173\n      paraphrase_qc_pass_rate_arc: 0.595\n      # 0.5B dose-response\n      mmlu_05B_d000: 0.398\n      mmlu_05B_d005: 0.326\n      mmlu_05B_d025: 0.280\n      mmlu_05B_d100: 0.233\n      arc_05B_d000: 0.469\n      arc_05B_d005: 0.329\n      arc_05B_d025: 0.320\n      arc_05B_d100: 0.294\n      gsm8k_05B_d000: 0.369\n      gsm8k_05B_d005: 0.362\n      gsm8k_05B_d025: 0.311\n      gsm8k_05B_d100: 0.365\n      # 1.5B dose-response — MC benchmarks immune\n      mmlu_15B_d000: 0.575\n      mmlu_15B_d005: 0.585\n      mmlu_15B_d025: 0.590\n      mmlu_15B_d100: 0.593\n      arc_15B_d000: 0.776\n      arc_15B_d005: 0.769\n      arc_15B_d025: 0.769\n      arc_15B_d100: 0.769\n      gsm8k_15B_d000: 0.637\n      gsm8k_15B_d005: 0.648\n      gsm8k_15B_d025: 0.654\n      gsm8k_15B_d100: 0.650\n      # 3B dose-response\n      mmlu_3B_d000: 0.630\n      mmlu_3B_d005: 0.634\n      mmlu_3B_d025: 0.621\n      mmlu_3B_d100: 0.632\n      arc_3B_d000: 0.818\n      arc_3B_d005: 0.829\n      arc_3B_d025: 0.811\n      arc_3B_d100: 0.824\n      gsm8k_3B_d000: 0.353\n      gsm8k_3B_d005: 0.208\n      gsm8k_3B_d025: 0.548\n      gsm8k_3B_d100: 0.742\n      cross_seed_std_mmlu: 0.015\n      cross_seed_std_arc: 0.025\n      cross_seed_std_gsm8k: 0.020\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT 注入本身是机械操作，成功率高。但 worst 档下暴露的关键问题：\n      (a) 0.5B 上 contamination 导致 MMLU 和 ARC 均下降而非上升——小模型容量不足，\n      将 paraphrase 纳入训练反而挤占有限参数空间导致 catastrophic forgetting（ARC -17pp 最极端）；\n      (b) 1.5B/3B 上 MC benchmark 几乎不受 dosage 影响（<2pp 变化），contamination 信号被模型容量吸收，\n      dose-response 曲线平坦，使得 γ 在这些 scale 上理论上就不可辨识；\n      (c) paraphrase QC pass rate 低（MMLU 47%，GSM8K 17%），意味着大量注入的 paraphrase 质量不够好，\n      模型可能学到的是 noisy reformulation 而非 memorization，削弱了 contamination 作为受控变量的内效度；\n      (d) GSM8K 3B d100 暴涨至 74.2% 是唯一明显的 inflation 信号，但这属于 open-ended task\n      在大模型上的特殊行为，与论文原始假设（MC benchmark inflation）方向不同。\n      整体上，dose-response 非单调、方向不一致，使得 \"calibration = subtract contamination effect\" 的前提崩塌。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Benchmark Accuracy by Scale × Dosage (mean ± std across 3 seeds)\"\n        columns: [Scale, Dosage, MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval]\n        rows:\n          - [0.5B, d000, \"0.398±0.013\", \"0.469±0.045\", \"0.369±0.013\", \"0.110±0.006\"]\n          - [0.5B, d005, \"0.326±0.018\", \"0.329±0.022\", \"0.362±0.004\", \"0.079±0.010\"]\n          - [0.5B, d025, \"0.280±0.012\", \"0.320±0.015\", \"0.311±0.030\", \"0.192±—\"]\n          - [0.5B, d100, \"0.233±0.037\", \"0.294±0.036\", \"0.365±0.011\", \"0.085±0.013\"]\n          - [1.5B, d000, \"0.576±0.001\", \"0.776±0.007\", \"0.637±0.003\", \"0.128±0.030\"]\n          - [1.5B, d005, \"0.585±—\", \"0.769±—\", \"0.648±—\", \"0.250±—\"]\n          - [1.5B, d025, \"0.590±—\", \"0.769±—\", \"0.654±—\", \"0.226±—\"]\n          - [1.5B, d100, \"0.593±0.002\", \"0.769±0.009\", \"0.650±0.004\", \"0.305±0.017\"]\n          - [3B, d000, \"0.630±0.005\", \"0.818±0.006\", \"0.353±0.120\", \"0.116±0.015\"]\n          - [3B, d005, \"0.634±—\", \"0.829±—\", \"0.208±—\", \"0.146±—\"]\n          - [3B, d025, \"0.621±—\", \"0.811±—\", \"0.548±—\", \"0.115±—\"]\n          - [3B, d100, \"0.632±0.007\", \"0.824±0.011\", \"0.742±0.030\", \"0.171±0.034\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Dose-response curves per benchmark×scale. 0.5B ARC/MMLU 显示负斜率（forgetting），1.5B/3B MC 平坦，GSM8K 3B 陡增。非单调性使 calibration 不可行。\"\n    analysis: >\n      worst 档下 exp-001 本身是 \"成功的\" 数据收集，但其结果恰恰证明了 calibration 的不可行性。\n      核心矛盾：contamination 效果是 benchmark-dependent、scale-dependent、direction-dependent 的，\n      不存在统一的 γ 来 \"subtract out\" 这些异质性效果。\n      这是论文 Part 3 (benchmark-dependent contamination effects) 的核心实证基础。\n      ARC catastrophic forgetting（0.5B d100 -17pp）和 GSM8K natural resistance\n      本身就是独立于方法是否 work 的有价值发现。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      Compute 4 detection signals on all contaminated + clean models.\n      Worst 档下：S1 是唯一在 0.5B d005 有效的信号，但在 1.5B/3B d005 也退化至 AUC<0.90；\n      S2 (Min-K++) 在所有条件下失败或反转；S3 (ConStat) 和 S4 (Self-Critique) 随机猜测水平。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B d005 within-model AUC\n      S1_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.953\n      S1_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.988\n      S1_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.995\n      S2_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.466\n      S2_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.465\n      S2_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.466\n      S3_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.52\n      S3_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.51\n      S3_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.53\n      S4_05B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.517\n      S4_05B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.495\n      S4_05B_d005_arc_auc: 0.433\n      # 0.5B d100 cross-model Cohen's d\n      S1_05B_d100_cohens_d: 3.60\n      S2_05B_d100_cohens_d: -1.98\n      S4_05B_d100_cohens_d: 0.45\n      # 1.5B d005 — S1 退化\n      S1_15B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.82\n      S1_15B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.85\n      S1_15B_d005_arc_auc: 0.88\n      S2_15B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.49\n      S2_15B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.48\n      S2_15B_d005_arc_auc: 0.50\n      S4_15B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.51\n      S4_15B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.50\n      S4_15B_d005_arc_auc: 0.49\n      # 3B d005 — S1 进一步退化\n      S1_3B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.78\n      S1_3B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.80\n      S1_3B_d005_arc_auc: 0.83\n      S2_3B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.51\n      S2_3B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.50\n      S2_3B_d005_arc_auc: 0.52\n      S4_3B_d005_mmlu_auc: 0.50\n      S4_3B_d005_gsm8k_auc: 0.49\n      S4_3B_d005_arc_auc: 0.48\n      effective_signals_at_05B: 1\n      effective_signals_at_15B: 0.5  # S1 marginal\n      effective_signals_at_3B: 0.3  # S1 below threshold\n    result_rationale: >\n      S1 (embedding similarity) 在 0.5B d005 强是因为小模型 embedding space 简单，paraphrase 和 original\n      的语义距离在低维空间中更易区分。随着模型规模增大，embedding space 维度和表征能力增加，\n      paraphrase 和 original 的 embedding 更加接近（更好的语义泛化），使得 S1 的区分力下降。\n      在 worst 档下，1.5B S1 AUC 降至 0.82-0.88（低于 exp-004 确定的 practical threshold 0.90），\n      3B 进一步降至 0.78-0.83。这意味着 S1 signal 的有效性严格受限于小模型，\n      在实际应用关切的较大模型上 S1 也不可靠。\n\n      S2 (Min-K++) 在 0.5B 上就已失败（AUC~0.47），且在 d100 时出现方向性反转（Cohen's d=-1.98），\n      这是因为 Min-K++ 依赖 token-level surprise：contaminated items 按假设应 less surprising，\n      但 0.5B 模型的 softmax 分布太平坦，contamination 反而通过 fine-tuning 改变了整体 calibration，\n      使 contaminated items 的 token probability 分布与 clean items 无法区分甚至反转。\n      这在更大模型上不会改善——larger models 有更好的 in-context learning 能力，\n      使得 fine-tuned memorization 和 in-context generalization 的信号更加纠缠。\n\n      S4 (Self-Critique) 依赖模型自我评估能力，0.5B 模型根本没有足够的 instruction-following\n      能力来可靠地进行 self-critique，因此 AUC 始终在 chance 水平。\n      在 1.5B/3B 上理论上应该改善，但 worst 档下假设 Self-Critique 对 SFT contamination\n      （而非 pre-training contamination）不敏感——SFT 改变的是 response distribution 而非\n      model's knowledge，Self-Critique 检测的是 knowledge discrepancy，因此无信号。\n\n      S3 (ConStat) 依赖 original vs paraphrase 的 performance gap，但 exp-001 已证明\n      1.5B/3B 上这个 gap <2pp（MC benchmarks immune），所以 ConStat 的 signal-to-noise ratio\n      接近 0，AUC 在 chance 水平。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Signal AUC Heatmap — d005 within-model detection\"\n        columns: [Signal, Scale, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC, Mean]\n        rows:\n          - [S1 (Embedding), 0.5B, 0.953, 0.988, 0.995, 0.979]\n          - [S1 (Embedding), 1.5B, 0.82, 0.85, 0.88, 0.85]\n          - [S1 (Embedding), 3B, 0.78, 0.80, 0.83, 0.80]\n          - [S2 (Min-K++), 0.5B, 0.466, 0.465, 0.466, 0.466]\n          - [S2 (Min-K++), 1.5B, 0.49, 0.48, 0.50, 0.49]\n          - [S2 (Min-K++), 3B, 0.51, 0.50, 0.52, 0.51]\n          - [S3 (ConStat), 0.5B, 0.52, 0.51, 0.53, 0.52]\n          - [S3 (ConStat), 1.5B, 0.50, 0.50, 0.51, 0.50]\n          - [S3 (ConStat), 3B, 0.49, 0.49, 0.50, 0.49]\n          - [S4 (Self-Critique), 0.5B, 0.517, 0.495, 0.433, 0.48]\n          - [S4 (Self-Critique), 1.5B, 0.51, 0.50, 0.49, 0.50]\n          - [S4 (Self-Critique), 3B, 0.50, 0.49, 0.48, 0.49]\n      - name: \"Table 3: d100 Cross-Model Cohen's d (0.5B)\"\n        columns: [Signal, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [S1, 3.82, 3.45, 3.53, \"Strong positive — correct direction\"]\n          - [S2, -2.11, -1.75, -2.08, \"Strong NEGATIVE — directional reversal\"]\n          - [S4, 0.52, 0.38, 0.45, \"Weak positive — near noise\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC heatmap. S1 shows clear scale degradation (green→yellow→orange as scale increases). S2-S4 uniformly red (chance level). Paper's Figure 2.\"\n    analysis: >\n      worst 档的核心发现：不存在跨 scale 可靠的检测信号。S1 在 0.5B 上的高 AUC (0.979)\n      是一个特殊条件下的结果，不能泛化到 1.5B/3B。这直接导致 Stage 2 IRT 的 exposure\n      输入质量在 1.5B/3B 上严重退化，使得 γ 估计变得 structurally unidentifiable。\n      Min-K++ 方向性反转 (Cohen's d = -1.98) 是论文最可引用的 cautionary finding——\n      reviewer 和社区需要知道这个信号不仅仅是 \"doesn't work\" 而是 \"actively misleads\"。\n      论文 Part 2 的核心贡献就是这个 signal failure mode characterization。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF fusion of 4 signals. Worst 档下：RRF 退化为 S1-only 模式，\n      因为其余 3 个信号贡献的是噪声而非信号，fusion 没有任何增益。\n    expected_results:\n      # RRF vs S1-only comparison (0.5B, per-item exposure correlation)\n      rrf_s1only_exposure_correlation: 0.97\n      rrf_vs_s1only_mae_gap: 0.005\n      rrf_vs_s1only_ranking_gap: 0.01\n      # Ablation: RRF vs single-signal (downstream MAE on calibrated scores)\n      rrf_4signal_mae: 0.078\n      s1_only_mae: 0.075\n      s2_only_mae: 0.145\n      s3_only_mae: 0.140\n      s4_only_mae: 0.138\n      rrf_2signal_closed_weight_mae: 0.142\n      # False positive injection robustness\n      fp_injection_5pct_mae_delta: 0.003\n      fp_injection_10pct_mae_delta: 0.008\n      fp_injection_20pct_mae_delta: 0.025\n      # 1.5B/3B: RRF = noise because even S1 degrades\n      rrf_15B_effective_auc: 0.80\n      rrf_3B_effective_auc: 0.75\n    result_rationale: >\n      当 3/4 信号在 chance level 时，RRF 的 rank fusion 本质上在把 noise ranks 和 signal ranks\n      混合。在 RRF 公式 score(d) = Σ 1/(k + rank_i(d)) 中，noise 信号的 rank 是随机排列，\n      其贡献是均匀分布的常数偏移，不改变 S1 的相对排序。因此 RRF ≈ S1-only\n      （exposure correlation 0.97），MAE gap 仅 0.005——在噪声范围内。\n\n      但 RRF 比 S1-only 略差而非略好，因为 noise signals 偶尔会把真正 high-exposure items\n      的 composite rank 拉向中间位置（rank dilution effect），引入微量 MAE 噪声。\n      这使得 RRF \"principled aggregation\" 的论证变成纯理论——在实际数据上没有 benefit。\n\n      Closed-weight 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) 更糟：两个 noise signals 的 fusion\n      仍然是 noise，MAE 接近 raw baseline（没有任何 calibration 效果）。\n\n      在 1.5B/3B 上，即使 S1 也退化，RRF 的 effective AUC 进一步降至 0.75-0.80，\n      低于 exp-004 确定的 practical identifiability threshold。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: RRF Ablation — Downstream Calibration MAE (0.5B, ARC)\"\n        columns: [Method, Exposure_AUC_equiv, MAE, Coverage_95, Kendall_tau]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF (4 signals), 0.82, 0.078, \"25%\", 0.62]\n          - [S1-only, 0.979, 0.075, \"25%\", 0.65]\n          - [S2-only, 0.47, 0.145, \"50%\", 0.30]\n          - [S3-only, 0.52, 0.140, \"55%\", 0.32]\n          - [S4-only, 0.48, 0.138, \"52%\", 0.28]\n          - [Closed-weight (S3+S4), 0.51, 0.142, \"53%\", 0.31]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: RRF vs S1-only item-level exposure scatter plot. Near-perfect correlation (r=0.97) confirms RRF degrades to dominant-signal mode.\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF 的 \"principled design choice\" 论证在 worst 档下变成：\n      \"we chose RRF to avoid meta-circularity; the cost is that when most signals fail,\n      it doesn't improve over the best individual signal, but it also doesn't degrade much.\"\n      这是一个 honest limitation，不是 contribution。论文 Discussion 中需要明确：\n      RRF 的价值是 architectural——当更好的 signals 可用时（future work），\n      framework 可以 seamlessly incorporate them。当前数据不支持 aggregation benefit claim。\n\n  - name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      144-condition synthetic sweep for identifiability. Worst 档下：sweep 揭示\n      N<50 + AUC<0.80 时 γ 结构性不可辨识。实际实验条件（N=8-16, AUC=0.75-0.85）\n      正好落在 unidentifiable zone 内。\n    expected_results:\n      # Completed conditions (actual data)\n      auc055_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.040\n      auc055_n20_coverage95: 0.80\n      auc055_n20_ci_width: 0.133\n      auc055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.026\n      auc055_n50_coverage95: 0.90\n      auc055_n100_gamma_rmse: 0.005\n      auc055_n100_coverage95: 1.00\n      auc080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.030\n      auc080_n50_ci_width: 0.163\n      auc080_n100_ci_width: 0.116\n      # Worst-tier predictions for missing conditions\n      auc065_n20_gamma_rmse: 0.055\n      auc065_n20_coverage95: 0.75\n      auc065_n20_ci_width: 0.175\n      auc065_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n      auc065_n50_coverage95: 0.85\n      auc065_n100_coverage95: 0.95\n      auc090_n20_ci_width: 0.320\n      auc090_n20_coverage95: 0.70\n      auc090_n50_ci_width: 0.207\n      auc090_n50_coverage95: 0.85\n      auc090_n100_ci_width: 0.145\n      # Critical finding: practical identifiability boundary\n      practical_threshold_auc: 0.80\n      practical_threshold_n: 50\n      ci_width_at_actual_conditions_n8_auc080: 0.42\n      ci_width_at_actual_conditions_n16_auc080: 0.30\n      ci_width_at_actual_conditions_n8_auc075: 0.48\n      # Fisher Information analysis\n      fisher_info_structural_identifiability_auc: 0.55\n      fisher_info_practical_identifiability_auc: 0.80\n      fisher_info_ci_width_floor_from_prior: 0.05\n      # Growing Pains pre-estimation\n      growing_pains_improvement_at_n20: 0.08  # CI width reduction\n      growing_pains_improvement_at_n50: 0.03\n      # AUC-CI width inflation paradox\n      ci_width_ratio_auc080_vs_auc055: 1.90\n    result_rationale: >\n      exp-004 已完成的数据（48/120 runs）确认了关键趋势：\n      (a) CI width 随 AUC 增大而非减小（1.87-1.95× inflation at AUC=0.80 vs 0.55），\n      这是 exposure-ability collinearity 的后果——更好的 exposure signal 意味着 exposure\n      更能预测 correctness，而 γ 需要区分 \"因为 exposed\" vs \"因为 able\"，两者越 collinear\n      越难分离；\n      (b) 1/√N scaling 成立但有常数项（prior variance floor），在小 N 时 prior 主导后验；\n      (c) N=20 时 coverage 仅 80%，远低于 nominal 95%。\n\n      在 worst 档下补充预测：\n      - AUC=0.65 条件可能因数值不稳定而系统性失败（v3-v5 已显示此模式），\n        即使部分成功也显示 CI width 在 N=20 时高达 0.175（>15pp），标记为 unidentifiable；\n      - AUC=0.90 条件下 CI width 进一步膨胀至 0.207-0.320（collinearity 更严重），\n        N=20 时覆盖率降至 70%；\n      - 推算到实际实验条件（N=8, AUC≈0.80）：CI width ≈ 0.42，即 γ 的 95% CI 宽度\n        为 ±21pp——无法区分 \"无污染\" 和 \"中等污染\"；\n      - 即使 pooling 到 N=16（multi-seed），CI width 仍 ≈ 0.30（±15pp），precision 不足\n        以支撑任何校准 claim；\n      - Fisher Information 分析给出 structural identifiability threshold AUC≥0.55\n        （参数唯一确定）但 practical identifiability threshold AUC≥0.80 + N≥50\n        （estimation quality sufficient for decisions）——当前条件远未达到 practical threshold。\n\n      这构成论文的 \"identifiability impossibility result\"：在现有信号质量和模型数量下，\n      γ 精确估计在理论上就不可行。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Identifiability Phase Diagram — CI Width by AUC × N\"\n        columns: [AUC, N=20, N=50, N=100, N=200]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.55\", \"0.133 ✓\", \"0.087 ✓\", \"0.064 ✓\", \"0.045 (pred)\"]\n          - [\"0.65\", \"0.175 ✗\", \"0.115 ✓\", \"0.082 ✓\", \"0.058 (pred)\"]\n          - [\"0.80\", \"0.258 ✗\", \"0.163 ✗\", \"0.116 ✓\", \"0.082 (pred)\"]\n          - [\"0.90\", \"0.320 ✗\", \"0.207 ✗\", \"0.145 ✗\", \"0.103 (pred)\"]\n        notes: \"✓ = CI width < 15pp (practical identifiability); ✗ = unidentifiable. Threshold: practical γ estimation requires ≤0.15 CI width.\"\n      - name: \"Table 6: Extrapolation to Actual Experimental Conditions\"\n        columns: [Condition, N_models, Signal_AUC, Predicted_CI_width, Verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.5B S1-only\", 8, 0.98, \"0.33\", \"Structurally identifiable but imprecise\"]\n          - [\"0.5B+1.5B pooled\", 16, 0.85, \"0.30\", \"Marginally identifiable\"]\n          - [\"1.5B S1-only\", 8, 0.85, \"0.45\", \"Unidentifiable\"]\n          - [\"3B S1-only\", 8, 0.80, \"0.48\", \"Unidentifiable\"]\n          - [\"Any scale, RRF\", 8, 0.75, \"0.52\", \"Unidentifiable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4 (paper): Identifiability phase diagram — AUC × N_models heatmap with CI width as color. Shaded region marks unidentifiable zone. Star markers show actual experimental conditions, all falling in or near unidentifiable zone.\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-004 在 worst 档下提供了论文最强的理论贡献：calibration 不 work 不是因为 implementation bug\n      或 prior choice，而是因为在 N<50 且 signal AUC<0.80 的条件下（这就是 LLM evaluation\n      的现实——你不会有 50+ 独立模型），γ 的后验精度根本不够支撑 calibration。\n      Fisher Info 分析形式化了这一点。\n      Reframe 为 \"impossibility result\" 后，这变成对社区的重要 warning：\n      \"don't try to calibrate with IRT unless you have >>50 models and AUC>>0.80 signals\"。\n      这是负面结果中最有理论深度的部分。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      Measurement error model for exposure noise. Worst 档下：ME model 对 coverage 无改善，\n      CI 对 σ_e 不敏感，噪声传播在 IRT 框架内被 prior 吸收。\n    expected_results:\n      # ME model results (from actual data)\n      me_model_converged: true\n      me_ci_width_range: [0.0997, 0.1000]\n      me_ci_monotonicity_rho: 0.4\n      me_ci_monotonicity_p: 0.5\n      me_coverage_95_improvement_vs_point: 0.0\n      # Post-hoc noise injection\n      noise_1x_gamma_shift: 0.02\n      noise_1x_ci_widening: 0.005\n      noise_15x_gamma_shift: 0.04\n      noise_15x_ci_widening: 0.008\n      noise_2x_gamma_shift: 0.07\n      noise_2x_ci_widening: 0.012\n      # Coverage with ME model\n      me_coverage_95_arc: 0.20\n      me_coverage_95_gsm8k: 0.30\n      me_coverage_80_arc: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      ME model 的 CI 对 σ_e 不敏感（range 仅 0.0997-0.1000）是因为：\n      (a) Bayesian posterior 在 N 很小时被 prior 主导，noise 信息被 prior 的 regularization 淹没；\n      (b) ME model 中 exposure_ij ~ N(τ_ij, σ_e²) 的 σ_e 被当作 known constant\n      而非 estimated parameter，所以它只影响 likelihood 的 weighting 而非 posterior 的 spread；\n      (c) 更本质地，coverage gap 的根因不是 exposure noise，而是 local independence violation\n      和 N 不足——ME model 解决的是错误的问题。\n\n      Post-hoc noise injection 也只产生微弱效果（CI widening < 1.2pp at 2× noise），\n      进一步证实 noise propagation 不是 coverage 的瓶颈。\n\n      worst 档下，ME model 对论文的贡献降级为 appendix 中的 null result：\n      \"we tried propagating detection noise; it didn't help because the coverage problem\n      is structural (local independence + small N), not measurement-error-driven.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Measurement Error Model — CI Width vs σ_e\"\n        columns: [σ_e, CI_width_gamma, CI_width_theta, Coverage_95, Δ_vs_point_estimate]\n        rows:\n          - [0.0 (point), 0.100, 0.15, \"25%\", \"—\"]\n          - [0.1, 0.0997, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [0.3, 0.0998, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [0.5, 0.0999, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [1.0, 0.1000, 0.15, \"25%\", \"0%\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ME model 是 Claim 3 (uncertainty propagation) 的核心实验，在 worst 档下完全失败。\n      论文中 Claim 3 需要被大幅削弱或合并到 exp-004 的 identifiability discussion 中。\n      不再 claim \"ContamCal explicitly propagates detection signal noise\"，\n      改为 \"detection noise is not the binding constraint; sample size and model misspecification are.\"\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      Fit 4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS) on controlled models. 核心 calibration 实验。\n      Worst 档下：MMLU 不收敛不可报告，GSM8K/ARC 在真实信号条件下 γ CI 包含 0，\n      所有条件下 MAE 不优于 raw baseline，coverage 崩塌至 18-33%。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU — fit failure\n      mmlu_perbench_rhat: 1.54\n      mmlu_perbench_ess: 7\n      mmlu_perbench_gamma: -3.81\n      mmlu_perbench_gamma_ci: [-7.02, 3.22]\n      mmlu_joint_rhat: 1.08\n      mmlu_joint_ess: 85\n      mmlu_reportable: false\n      # GSM8K — oracle significant, real signal not\n      gsm8k_oracle_gamma: 3.773\n      gsm8k_oracle_gamma_ci: [2.741, 4.714]\n      gsm8k_oracle_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      gsm8k_oracle_rhat: 1.002\n      gsm8k_oracle_mae: 0.092\n      gsm8k_oracle_coverage_95: 0.31\n      gsm8k_oracle_ppp: 0.0\n      gsm8k_s1only_gamma: 0.187\n      gsm8k_s1only_gamma_ci: [-0.917, 1.329]\n      gsm8k_s1only_gamma_excludes_zero: false\n      gsm8k_s1only_rhat: 1.015\n      gsm8k_s1only_ess: 330\n      gsm8k_s1only_mae: 0.037\n      gsm8k_s1only_coverage_95: 0.50\n      gsm8k_s1only_ppp: 0.336\n      gsm8k_rrf_gamma: 0.12\n      gsm8k_rrf_gamma_ci: [-0.74, 0.96]\n      gsm8k_rrf_gamma_excludes_zero: false\n      # ARC — oracle marginal, real signal significant but calibration bad\n      arc_oracle_gamma: -2.83\n      arc_oracle_gamma_ci: [-4.10, -1.56]\n      arc_oracle_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_oracle_mae: 0.076\n      arc_oracle_coverage_95: 0.18\n      arc_oracle_ppp: 1.0\n      arc_s1only_gamma: -1.464\n      arc_s1only_gamma_ci: [-2.51, -0.41]\n      arc_s1only_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_s1only_mae: 0.035\n      arc_s1only_coverage_95: 0.625\n      arc_s1only_ppp: 0.968\n      arc_s1only_kendall_tau: 0.756\n      arc_rrf_gamma: -2.347\n      arc_rrf_gamma_ci: [-3.46, -1.19]\n      arc_rrf_gamma_excludes_zero: true\n      arc_rrf_mae: 0.035\n      arc_rrf_coverage_95: 0.625\n      # Baselines (ARC, N=8)\n      arc_B0_raw_mae: 0.059\n      arc_B1_remove_rescore_mae: 0.059\n      arc_B2_2pl_gamma_mae: 0.064\n      arc_B3_vanilla_4pl_mae: 0.071\n      arc_B4_linear_regression_mae: 0.056\n      arc_B5_emperor_mae: 0.059\n      arc_B6_dcr_fuzzy_mae: 0.245\n      # Baselines (GSM8K, N=8)\n      gsm8k_B0_raw_mae: 0.003\n      gsm8k_B4_linear_mae: 0.003\n      gsm8k_B3_vanilla_4pl_mae: 0.012\n      gsm8k_B6_dcr_fuzzy_mae: 0.263\n      # Key summary metrics for worst tier\n      gamma_significance_rate: 0.08  # 1/12 benchmark×signal combinations\n      mae_vs_raw_delta: 0.035  # IRT MAE minus raw MAE (positive = worse)\n      coverage_95_mean: 0.28\n      kendall_tau_mean: 0.52\n      ppp_range: [0.0, 1.0]  # both extremes indicate misspecification\n    result_rationale: >\n      MMLU 不收敛（rhat=1.54, ESS=7）的原因：\n      (a) 14042 items 的 MMLU 在 NUTS 中计算量巨大，subsample 到 1000 items 时\n      失去了 per-item parameter 的稳定性；\n      (b) MMLU 的 contamination effect 极微弱（1.5B/3B <2pp），在 0.5B 上是负方向，\n      NUTS 在搜索后验时无法找到 γ 的 stable mode；\n      (c) 3B 也出现类似问题——rhat=1.08, ESS=85——说明这不是 0.5B 特有的。\n      结论：MMLU 结果不可报告。\n\n      GSM8K oracle γ=3.77 显著（CI [2.74, 4.71]）但 MAE=0.092 远差于 raw baseline\n      MAE=0.003。这是因为 GSM8K 本身不受 contamination 影响（自然抗性），\n      raw scores 已经接近 ground truth，任何 \"calibration\" 都是在 add noise 而非 remove bias。\n      oracle γ 显著只是因为 oracle 使用 ground-truth dosage，IRT 能 fit 一个统计显著的\n      关联，但这个关联没有 practical utility——calibrated score 比 raw score 差 9pp。\n      在真实信号（S1-only）条件下，γ=0.19 不显著（CI 包含 0），\n      因为 S1 signal 与 GSM8K contamination 无关联（open-ended task 天然抗 memorization）。\n\n      ARC 是唯一 \"partially working\" 的 benchmark：S1-only γ=-1.46 显著（CI 排除 0），\n      MAE=0.035 优于 raw MAE=0.059。但 coverage 仅 62.5%（N=8 only 5 models covered），\n      且 PPP=0.97 表明 severe misspecification——模型预测的 item response pattern\n      与观测数据严重不符。在 worst 档下，如果增加 multi-seed 到 N=16，\n      coverage 可能仍不改善（exp-004 显示 N=20 AUC=0.80 时 coverage 也仅 90%），\n      而 PPP 极端值（ARC=1.0, GSM8K=0.0）表明 additive γ 模型根本不适合\n      这些 benchmark 的 contamination structure。\n\n      综合：γ 显著率 ~8%（12 个 benchmark×signal 组合中仅 ARC×S1 一个），\n      calibration 从不优于 raw baseline（除 ARC 略好但 coverage 崩塌），\n      \"calibration\" 这个 claim 完全不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: IRT 4PL+γ Calibration Results (per-benchmark fitting)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, Signal, γ, \"γ CI\", \"Excl. 0?\", rhat, MAE, \"Raw MAE\", Coverage_95, PPP]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, oracle, -3.81, \"[-7.02, 3.22]\", No, 1.54, \"—\", 0.099, \"—\", 0.75]\n          - [MMLU, S1-only, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \">1.1\", \"—\", 0.099, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [MMLU, RRF, -0.21, \"[-1.01, 0.59]\", No, 1.08, \"—\", 0.099, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [GSM8K, oracle, 3.77, \"[2.74, 4.71]\", Yes, 1.002, 0.092, 0.003, \"31%\", 0.0]\n          - [GSM8K, S1-only, 0.19, \"[-0.92, 1.33]\", No, 1.015, 0.037, 0.003, \"50%\", 0.34]\n          - [GSM8K, RRF, 0.12, \"[-0.74, 0.96]\", No, 1.015, 0.036, 0.003, \"50%\", 0.34]\n          - [ARC, oracle, -2.83, \"[-4.10, -1.56]\", Yes, 1.006, 0.076, 0.059, \"18%\", 1.0]\n          - [ARC, S1-only, -1.46, \"[-2.51, -0.41]\", Yes, 1.010, 0.035, 0.059, \"63%\", 0.97]\n          - [ARC, RRF, -2.35, \"[-3.46, -1.19]\", Yes, 1.008, 0.035, 0.059, \"63%\", 1.0]\n      - name: \"Table 9: Baseline Comparison (ARC, N=8 models)\"\n        columns: [Method, MAE, Coverage_95, Sharpness, Kendall_tau]\n        rows:\n          - [\"B0: Raw (no adjustment)\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\", 0.800]\n          - [\"B1: Remove-and-rescore\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\", 0.800]\n          - [\"B2: Single-signal 2PL+γ\", 0.064, \"—\", \"—\", 0.690]\n          - [\"B3: Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\", 0.071, \"—\", \"—\", 0.650]\n          - [\"B4: Linear regression\", 0.056, \"87.5%\", \"0.12\", 0.756]\n          - [\"B5: Emperor's mitigation\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\", 0.780]\n          - [\"B6: DCR fuzzy\", 0.245, \"37.5%\", \"0.05\", 0.378]\n          - [\"IRT 4PL+γ (ours)\", 0.035, \"62.5%\", \"0.068\", 0.756]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5 (paper): Calibrated-vs-true accuracy scatter with CIs. ARC shows IRT points closer to diagonal but CIs miss true values for 3/8 models. GSM8K shows IRT adds noise to already-good raw scores. MMLU absent (fit failed).\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-006 是论文 Claim 1 (calibration) 的决定性实验。在 worst 档下：\n      - MMLU 不可报告 → 论文丢失 primary benchmark\n      - GSM8K γ 不显著 + MAE 比 raw 差 → negative control 确认，但 \"calibration works\" 无据\n      - ARC γ 显著且 MAE 改善 → 唯一正面结果，但 coverage 62.5% + PPP 极端 → 模型 misspecified\n      - Linear regression (B4) 在 coverage (87.5%) 上远优于 IRT (62.5%)，且 MAE 仅差 2pp → \n        reviewer 会问 \"why use IRT at all when linear regression works better?\"\n      这使得 calibration claim 完全不可持续。论文 reframe 为 \"why calibration fails\"\n      并指出 structural reasons (N, local independence, signal quality)。\n\n  - name: sft_d100_qc_only\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      100% dosage SFT using only QC-pass paraphrases. Isolates noisy contamination confound.\n      Worst 档下：QC-only 结果与 full d100 几乎无差异，说明 paraphrase quality\n      不是 calibration 失败的原因。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_d100_qc_only: 0.240\n      arc_d100_qc_only: 0.285\n      gsm8k_d100_qc_only: 0.360\n      mmlu_delta_vs_full_d100: 0.008\n      arc_delta_vs_full_d100: -0.009\n      gsm8k_delta_vs_full_d100: -0.005\n      qc_items_used: 7547\n      total_items_available: 16697\n    result_rationale: >\n      QC-only 使用 7547 个通过质量检验的 paraphrase（占 45%），移除了 cosine similarity\n      低于 0.85 或 BLEU 高于 0.3 的 noisy paraphrase。但在 worst 档下，\n      clean vs noisy paraphrase 的差异可以忽略（<1pp），因为：\n      (a) 0.5B 模型的 catastrophic forgetting 是由训练数据量引起的（d100 增加了 ~5K extra items\n      到 training set），而非 paraphrase 质量——即使 paraphrase 都是 perfect semantic copies，\n      额外训练数据仍会挤占有限容量；\n      (b) 模型太小，无法区分 high-quality 和 low-quality paraphrase——\n      两者在 0.5B 模型看来都是 \"新的训练 examples\"，效果相同；\n      (c) 这排除了 \"noisy contamination confound\" 作为 calibration 失败的 alibi，\n      把注意力引回 structural causes。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-015 作为 orphaned experiment，在 worst 档下的价值是排除了一个 potential alibi：\n      \"calibration 之所以失败是因为 paraphrase quality 不够好\"。QC-only 结果证明\n      即使用最高质量的 paraphrase，结果也一样——问题出在 framework 本身，不是数据质量。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels.\n      Worst 档下：7B 上 MC benchmarks 完全免疫于 contamination，MMLU IRT 同样不收敛，\n      S1 signal 进一步退化。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_7B_d000: 0.715\n      mmlu_7B_d005: 0.717\n      mmlu_7B_d025: 0.718\n      mmlu_7B_d100: 0.720\n      arc_7B_d000: 0.870\n      arc_7B_d005: 0.872\n      arc_7B_d025: 0.871\n      arc_7B_d100: 0.873\n      gsm8k_7B_d000: 0.780\n      gsm8k_7B_d005: 0.782\n      gsm8k_7B_d025: 0.785\n      gsm8k_7B_d100: 0.790\n      humaneval_7B_d000: 0.350\n      humaneval_7B_d100: 0.420\n      max_dosage_effect_mc: 0.005  # <0.5pp on any MC benchmark\n      S1_7B_d005_auc: 0.72\n      mmlu_irt_7B_rhat: 1.12\n      mmlu_irt_7B_reportable: false\n      arc_irt_7B_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      gsm8k_irt_7B_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B 模型有足够的参数容量吸收 SFT contamination 而不影响 benchmark performance。\n      在 1.5B 上已经观察到 MC benchmarks 几乎不受 contamination 影响（<1pp），\n      7B 会进一步压平 dose-response 曲线至 noise level（<0.5pp）。\n      原因：larger models 的 LoRA rank 16 只改变了参数的极小比例（7B 的 16/7000M ≈ 0.0002%），\n      contaminated examples 的信号被 pre-training knowledge 稀释。\n\n      S1 signal 在 7B 上 AUC 降至 0.72：embedding space 更加丰富，\n      paraphrase 和 original 的语义表征更接近（更好的泛化 = 更难检测）。\n      这使得 exp-004 的 identifiability impossibility result 在 7B scale 上更加严峻：\n      AUC=0.72 + N≤8 → CI width > 0.5 → completely unidentifiable。\n\n      MMLU IRT 不收敛（rhat=1.12）与 0.5B/3B 一致——不是 scale-specific 问题，\n      而是 MMLU 的 item structure 与 4PL IRT 在 small-N regime 下不兼容。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: 7B Dose-Response (worst tier)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d005, d025, d100, \"Max Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.715, 0.717, 0.718, 0.720, \"+0.5pp\"]\n          - [ARC, 0.870, 0.872, 0.871, 0.873, \"+0.3pp\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.780, 0.782, 0.785, 0.790, \"+1.0pp\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.350, 0.370, 0.395, 0.420, \"+7.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Supplement: 7B dose-response curves appended to Figure 1. MC benchmarks 完全平坦，HumanEval 仍有 dose-response。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B 数据在 worst 档下强化了论文的核心 negative message：\n      contamination calibration 在大模型上更不可行（effect size 趋向 0 + signal quality 下降），\n      而在小模型上虽然 effect size 大但方向不一致（forgetting vs inflation）。\n      IRT calibration 在任何 scale 上都没有 practical utility。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      Systematic evaluation of detection signal reliability across scales and regimes.\n      Worst 档下：S1 在 1.5B/3B d005 也退化至 AUC<0.90，\n      所有信号在 Instruct/RL 模型上完全失效。\n    expected_results:\n      # 0.5B results (actual data)\n      S1_05B_d005_auc_mean: 0.979\n      S2_05B_d005_auc_mean: 0.465\n      S4_05B_d005_auc_mean: 0.481\n      S1_05B_d100_cross_cohens_d: 3.60\n      S2_05B_d100_cross_cohens_d: -1.98\n      S4_05B_d100_cross_cohens_d: 0.45\n      effective_signals_at_05B: 1\n      # 1.5B predictions (worst tier)\n      S1_15B_d005_auc_mean: 0.84\n      S2_15B_d005_auc_mean: 0.49\n      S4_15B_d005_auc_mean: 0.50\n      effective_signals_at_15B: 0\n      # 3B predictions (worst tier)\n      S1_3B_d005_auc_mean: 0.80\n      S2_3B_d005_auc_mean: 0.51\n      S4_3B_d005_auc_mean: 0.49\n      effective_signals_at_3B: 0\n      # Instruct/RL proxy\n      S1_05B_instruct_d005_auc: 0.52\n      S2_05B_instruct_d005_auc: 0.48\n      S4_05B_instruct_d005_auc: 0.47\n      signals_surviving_instruct: 0\n      # Min-K++ reversal (key finding)\n      minkpp_reversal_cohens_d_mmlu: -2.11\n      minkpp_reversal_cohens_d_gsm8k: -1.75\n      minkpp_reversal_cohens_d_arc: -2.08\n      minkpp_reversal_consistent_across_benchmarks: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      S1 (embedding) d005 AUC 在 1.5B/3B 退化的机制：\n      更大模型的 sentence embedding space 学到更好的语义泛化，\n      使 paraphrase 和 original 的 embedding 更接近。0.5B 模型 embedding space\n      相对 \"粗糙\"，paraphrase 和 original 落在不同的 local regions（AUC=0.98），\n      但 1.5B/3B 的 embedding 足以 \"理解\" paraphrase 是同一问题的另一种表述（AUC 降至 0.80-0.84）。\n      这不是 S1 的 bug——这是更好的语言理解与检测之间的根本矛盾。\n\n      S2/S4 在所有 scale 都在 chance level：\n      - S2 (Min-K++) 的 token-level surprise 在 LoRA fine-tuning 后没有系统性变化——\n        LoRA 修改的参数太少（rank 16）不足以改变 token probability distribution\n        到 Min-K++ 可检测的程度。d100 的方向性反转（Cohen's d=-1.98）是因为\n        contaminated training 微调了模型的 overall calibration（average token entropy 变化），\n        使 contaminated items 看起来 MORE surprising（反直觉）。\n      - S4 (Self-Critique) 需要 instruction-following 能力，SFT models 的 self-critique\n        能力不稳定，尤其是在被 contamination SFT 微调后 critique 能力可能被进一步破坏。\n\n      Instruct/RL proxy 全部信号失效（AUC≈0.50）：\n      Instruct 模型经过 RLHF/DPO 后，response distribution 完全改变，\n      所有基于 pre-training/SFT 阶段的信号（embedding similarity, token surprise,\n      performance gap, self-critique）都不再有效。RL 相当于在信号上叠加了巨大的噪声。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Signal Survival Heatmap — d005 AUC by Scale\"\n        columns: [Signal, 0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, \"Instruct 0.5B\", Verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [\"S1 (Embedding)\", \"0.979 ✓\", \"0.84 ✗\", \"0.80 ✗\", \"0.52 ✗\", \"0.5B-only\"]\n          - [\"S2 (Min-K++)\", \"0.465 ✗\", \"0.49 ✗\", \"0.51 ✗\", \"0.48 ✗\", \"Never works\"]\n          - [\"S4 (Self-Critique)\", \"0.481 ✗\", \"0.50 ✗\", \"0.49 ✗\", \"0.47 ✗\", \"Never works\"]\n        notes: \"✓ = AUC > 0.90 (practical threshold); ✗ = AUC < 0.90\"\n      - name: \"Table 12: Min-K++ Directional Reversal at d100 (0.5B)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, \"Cohen's d\", Direction, \"Expected Direction\", Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, -2.11, \"Contaminated looks MORE surprising\", Less surprising, \"Active misleading\"]\n          - [GSM8K, -1.75, \"Contaminated looks MORE surprising\", Less surprising, \"Active misleading\"]\n          - [ARC, -2.08, \"Contaminated looks MORE surprising\", Less surprising, \"Active misleading\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (paper): Signal × Scale AUC heatmap. S1 column shows green (0.5B) → orange (1.5B) → red (3B) gradient. S2/S4 uniformly red. This is the paper's most visually striking finding.\"\n      - \"Figure (supplement): Min-K++ score distributions for d000 vs d100, showing the reversal — contaminated distribution shifted RIGHT (higher surprise), opposite to theoretical expectation.\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-008 在 worst 档下提供论文 Part 2 的全部内容：\n      (a) 没有任何信号在所有 scale 上 survive（S1 仅限 0.5B）；\n      (b) Min-K++ 方向性反转是最引人注目的 cautionary finding——\n      如果社区依赖 Min-K++ 检测 contamination，他们可能会得到完全相反的结论；\n      (c) Instruct/RL 模型使所有信号失效，这对 \"real-world contamination detection\" \n      是致命打击——实际部署的模型都经过 RLHF，我们的检测工具对它们无效。\n\n  - name: multi_family_validation\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Controlled SFT injection on Llama-3.2-1B or Pythia-1.4B.\n      Worst 档下：其他 model family 表现出类似的失败模式，\n      确认 negative results 不是 Qwen-specific。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_1b_d000_mmlu: 0.32\n      llama_1b_d000_arc: 0.42\n      llama_1b_d000_gsm8k: 0.15\n      llama_1b_d025_mmlu: 0.30\n      llama_1b_d025_arc: 0.39\n      llama_1b_d025_gsm8k: 0.14\n      llama_1b_d100_mmlu: 0.27\n      llama_1b_d100_arc: 0.35\n      llama_1b_d100_gsm8k: 0.16\n      llama_1b_arc_delta_d100: -0.07  # forgetting but less severe than Qwen 0.5B\n      llama_S1_d005_auc: 0.91\n      llama_S2_d005_auc: 0.50\n      llama_irt_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      llama_irt_coverage_95: 0.25\n      cross_family_gamma_correlation: 0.45  # weak, not the r=0.91 hoped for\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B 在类似 scale (1B vs 0.5B) 下会展示类似的 catastrophic forgetting\n      pattern（ARC -7pp，比 Qwen 0.5B 的 -17pp 小因为 Llama 基础能力不同），\n      但方向一致（negative gamma for ARC）。\n\n      MMLU/GSM8K dose-response 同样平坦（small model absorbs contamination differently）。\n      S1 AUC 可能略好于 Qwen 0.5B（Llama 的 embedding space 不同），\n      但仍不足以使 IRT γ CI 排除 0（N 太小 + AUC 不够高）。\n\n      cross-family γ correlation 仅 0.45（而非希望的 0.91），因为\n      contamination effect 不是 benchmark property alone——它是\n      benchmark × model architecture × model scale 的交互效应。\n      这进一步削弱了 \"per-benchmark γ_k as benchmark property\" 的 claim。\n\n      在 worst 档下，exp-014 的价值是确认负面结果的 generalizability：\n      \"it's not just Qwen——calibration fails for Llama too.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Multi-Family Validation (Llama-3.2-1B)\"\n        columns: [Benchmark, d000, d025, d100, \"Δ(d100-d000)\", \"Qwen 0.5B Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.32, 0.30, 0.27, \"-5pp\", \"-16pp\"]\n          - [ARC, 0.42, 0.39, 0.35, \"-7pp\", \"-17pp\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.15, 0.14, 0.16, \"+1pp\", \"~0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Supplement: Llama vs Qwen dose-response comparison. Both show ARC forgetting, but magnitude differs — contamination effect is family-dependent, weakening per-benchmark γ_k as universal parameter.\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-014 在 worst 档下排除了 \"Qwen-specific artifact\" 的 reviewer concern，\n      但代价是揭示了更深层的问题：contamination effect 的 magnitude 是 model-family-dependent，\n      使得 IRT 的 γ_k 不能被视为 benchmark 的 intrinsic property。\n      这进一步削弱了方法的 generalizability claim。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      Apply signals to existing RL-trained models (Instruct series, DeepSeek-R1).\n      Worst 档下：所有信号失效，CIs 极宽，expected regret 无改善。\n    expected_results:\n      # Signal quality on RL models\n      S1_qwen_instruct_05B_auc: 0.52\n      S1_qwen_instruct_15B_auc: 0.50\n      S1_qwen_instruct_3B_auc: 0.51\n      S1_qwen_instruct_7B_auc: 0.49\n      S1_deepseek_r1_15B_auc: 0.48\n      S1_deepseek_r1_7B_auc: 0.50\n      all_signals_rl_auc_range: [0.45, 0.55]\n      # IRT fitting on RL models\n      irt_rl_gamma_ci_width: 0.85\n      irt_rl_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      irt_rl_coverage_95: 0.95  # trivially high because CIs are extremely wide\n      irt_rl_sharpness: 0.42  # useless CIs\n      # Expected regret\n      regret_uncalibrated: 0.12\n      regret_calibrated: 0.13\n      regret_remove_rescore: 0.11\n      regret_improvement: -0.01  # calibrated slightly WORSE\n      # Specificity check\n      near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark: true\n      near_zero_gamma_value: 0.05\n      near_zero_gamma_ci: [-0.40, 0.50]\n    result_rationale: >\n      RL/RLHF post-training 完全破坏了所有检测信号：\n      (a) embedding space 被 RLHF 重塑——reward model optimization 改变了 hidden representations\n      的 geometry，使 pre-training 时的 contamination traces 在 embedding 中不再可识别；\n      (b) token probability distribution 被 RLHF 剧烈改变（更 \"aligned\"），\n      Min-K++ 的 token surprise 完全失效；\n      (c) Self-Critique 在 Instruct 模型上可能略好（instruction-following 能力强），\n      但 RLHF 对 self-evaluation 的 calibration 也发生了改变。\n\n      当所有信号 AUC≈0.50 时，IRT exposure score 是纯噪声，\n      γ posterior 完全由 prior 决定（CI width = 0.85），coverage 95% 只是因为 CI 宽到\n      包含一切（sharpness = 0.42，即 ±21pp 的 CI 没有任何信息量）。\n\n      Expected regret analysis：uncalibrated 和 calibrated 的 top-5 model selection\n      几乎相同（regret gap =-0.01），因为 calibrated scores 是 raw scores + noise，\n      model ranking 保持原样。remove-and-rescore 略好只因它 drops items\n      从而 reduces variance，但也不显著。\n\n      Near-zero γ specificity check 通过（clean benchmark 上 γ≈0.05, CI 包含 0），\n      但这是一个 trivial result——当信号是噪声时，γ 自然接近 prior mean (0)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: RL Observational Study — Signal AUC\"\n        columns: [Model, S1, S2, S4, \"Any signal > 0.60?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, 0.52, 0.48, 0.47, No]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 0.50, 0.49, 0.50, No]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, 0.51, 0.50, 0.49, No]\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 0.49, 0.51, 0.50, No]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B, 0.48, 0.47, 0.50, No]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B, 0.50, 0.50, 0.49, No]\n      - name: \"Table 15: Expected Regret — Top-5 Model Selection\"\n        columns: [Method, \"Regret (MAE vs oracle ranking)\", \"Δ vs Raw\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Raw (uncalibrated), 0.12, \"—\"]\n          - [ContamCal (calibrated), 0.13, \"+0.01 (worse)\"]\n          - [Remove-and-rescore, 0.11, \"-0.01\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-009 在 worst 档下给出论文 Limitations 的核心内容：\n      \"ContamCal's calibration is only as good as its input signals.\n      For RL-post-trained models — which constitute the majority of deployed LLMs — \n      all available detection signals fail, rendering calibration uninformative.\"\n      这是一个 honest limitation 而非隐藏的 failure。\n      论文 framing：calibration 需要 reliable detection，而 reliable detection\n      目前仅限于 SFT-stage 小模型——这本身是对社区的 important message。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only).\n      Worst 档下：frontier model 上信号全部失效，只能做定性分析。\n    expected_results:\n      S1_72B_auc: 0.50\n      S2_72B_auc: 0.51\n      S4_72B_auc: 0.49\n      irt_gamma_ci_width: 0.90\n      irt_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      qualitative_contamination_evidence: \"none detectable\"\n      mmlu_72B_accuracy: 0.845\n      arc_72B_accuracy: 0.920\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B 模型在所有信号维度上都在 chance level：\n      (a) embedding space 极其高维和复杂，paraphrase/original 区分无意义；\n      (b) 72B 的 in-context learning 能力意味着即使没有 memorization，\n      模型也能 \"理解\" 测试题的结构并正确回答，使 memorization signal 不可区分于 capability；\n      (c) 72B pre-training data 极大，contamination 的 marginal effect 极小\n      （即使测试集在训练集中，它只占训练数据的 < 0.001%）。\n\n      IRT fitting 在 single-model inference 下只有 1 个 \"examinee\"，\n      无法估计 person parameters，只能做 item-level analysis——\n      但 item parameters 也需要多个 examinees 才能稳定估计。\n      结果是 γ 的 CI 极宽（0.90），完全无信息量。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-012 在 worst 档下仅作为 Limitations 中的 \"scaling limit\" 证据：\n      \"at frontier scales (72B), all detection signals are at chance level,\n      confirming that post-hoc contamination calibration cannot currently operate\n      at the scales most relevant to the community.\"\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight models.\n      Worst 档下：2-signal ≈ noise，calibration 完全失效。\n    expected_results:\n      constat_auc_05B: 0.52\n      selfcritique_auc_05B: 0.48\n      rrf_2signal_effective_auc: 0.50\n      irt_2signal_gamma_ci_width: 0.95\n      irt_2signal_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n      irt_2signal_mae: 0.140\n      irt_2signal_coverage_95: 0.95  # trivially high, CIs are entire range\n      irt_2signal_vs_4signal_mae_gap: 0.062\n      irt_2signal_vs_raw_mae_gap: 0.081  # much worse than raw\n    result_rationale: >\n      ConStat 和 Self-Critique 在 0.5B 上的 AUC 都在 chance level（0.48-0.52），\n      它们的 RRF fusion 仍然是 noise（effective AUC ≈ 0.50）。\n      IRT 接收到的 exposure scores 是纯随机排序，\n      γ posterior 完全退化到 prior（CI width = 0.95）。\n\n      Calibrated scores 比 raw scores 差 8pp MAE（0.140 vs 0.059），\n      因为 noise exposure 在 calibration 公式中引入了 systematic error。\n      Coverage 95% 但 sharpness 接近 0（CIs 太宽没有信息量）。\n\n      这在 worst 档下完全排除了 closed-weight applicability：\n      对于 GPT-4, Claude 等 closed-weight models，ContamCal 没有任何适用性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration (0.5B, ARC)\"\n        columns: [Mode, \"Effective AUC\", MAE, Coverage_95, Sharpness]\n        rows:\n          - [\"4-signal RRF\", 0.82, 0.078, \"25%\", 0.12]\n          - [\"S1-only\", 0.979, 0.035, \"63%\", 0.068]\n          - [\"2-signal (closed-weight)\", 0.50, 0.140, \"95%\", 0.45]\n          - [\"Raw (no adjustment)\", \"—\", 0.059, \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      exp-013 在 worst 档下给出论文 Limitations 的 closed-weight 段：\n      \"For closed-weight models where only ConStat and Self-Critique are applicable,\n      calibration degrades below the raw baseline. This limits ContamCal's applicability\n      to open-weight models where embedding-based signals are available.\"\n      这是 honest but damaging limitation，reviewer 会 note 这严重限制了 practical impact。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"656feef8-1f1e-423a-a936-6b6196c229f5","total_cost_usd":1.1610847999999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41705,"cache_read_input_tokens":138599,"output_tokens":22962,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41705,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":21058,"cache_read_input_tokens":44655,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8891,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8891},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":23655,"outputTokens":8686,"cacheReadInputTokens":697503,"cacheCreationInputTokens":96175,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.25705405000000003,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,